const RECIPES = [{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/11758/baked-ziti-i/","title":"Baked Ziti","categories":["Pasta"],"description":"Baked ziti pasta with ground beef, spaghetti sauce, and three kinds of Italian cheese makes a surprisingly easy, family-pleasing weeknight meal.","prepTime":"15 mins","cookTime":"45 mins","totalTime":"1 hr","yield":"10 servings (1 9x13-inch casserole)","ingredients":["1 pound dry ziti pasta","1 onion, chopped","1 pound lean ground beef","2 (26 ounce) jars spaghetti sauce","6 ounces provolone cheese, sliced","1.5 cups sour cream","6 ounces mozzarella cheese, shredded","2 tablespoons grated Parmesan cheese"],"instructions":["Gather all ingredients.","Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Add ziti pasta, and cook until al dente, about 8 minutes; drain.","Meanwhile, brown ground beef and onion in a large skillet over medium heat; stir in spaghetti sauce and simmer for 15 minutes. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Butter a 9x13-inch baking dish.","Spread 1/2 of the ziti in the bottom of the prepared dish.","Top with Provolone cheese.","Top with sour cream.","Add 1/2 of the meat sauce, remaining ziti, mozzarella cheese, and remaining meat sauce. Top with grated Parmesan cheese.","Bake in the preheated oven until heated through and cheeses have melted, about 30 minutes."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YP8Y1qn9kAwRDYyf0wXpZP5JilI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-JF-11758-Baked-Ziti-ddmfs-3x4-0630757a10b1492e85daab40662225b3.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/165350/baked-ziti-with-sausage/","title":"Baked Ziti with Sausage","categories":["Pasta"],"description":"Baked ziti with sausage cooked until bubbly with spaghetti sauce, cheese, and sausage. This is a pasta recipe with delicious, comforting flavor.","prepTime":"20 mins","cookTime":"40 mins","totalTime":"1 hr","yield":"8 servings","ingredients":["cooking spray","1 (16 ounce) package dry ziti pasta","1 pound mild Italian sausage","1 (15 ounce) container ricotta cheese","1 large yellow onion, minced","1 large egg","2 teaspoons minced garlic","1 teaspoon dried oregano","0.5 teaspoon salt","0.5 teaspoon ground black pepper","1.5 (26 ounce) jars spaghetti sauce, divided","1 (8 ounce) package shredded Italian cheese blend","1 teaspoon dried basil"],"instructions":["Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a 9x13-inch baking dish.","Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a rolling boil over high heat. Stir in ziti and return to a boil. Cook pasta uncovered, stirring occasionally, until cooked through but still firm to the bite, about 8 minutes. Drain well.","While pasta is cooking, heat a large skillet over medium heat. Add sausage; cook and stir until brown, about 10 minutes. Drain sausage and set aside.","Stir together ricotta, onion, egg, garlic, and oregano in a large bowl until well combined. Stir in pasta, sausage, salt, pepper, and the half jar of spaghetti sauce; mix well.","Cover the bottom of the prepared baking dish with 1/3 of the full jar spaghetti sauce. Layer with 1/2 of the pasta mixture, 1/2 of the remaining spaghetti sauce, and 1/2 of the shredded cheese. Repeat layers once more using remaining pasta, sauce, and cheese. Sprinkle basil over top and cover the dish tightly with aluminum foil.","Bake in the preheated oven until heated through, about 20 minutes. Uncover; return to the oven and bake until cheese is melted, 5 to 10 more minutes."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IwtFbLQkLqbeoWr_14vMe1Awvm8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/165350baked-ziti-with-sausageYolyvideo4x3-aca1dd14727c43aaa42fa2e244de76a6.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/8461551/cast-iron-roast-chicken-and-potatoes/","title":"Cast Iron Roast Chicken and Potatoes","categories":["Chicken"],"description":"A whole chicken is cooked in a cast iron pan with rosemary roast potatoes until perfectly crisp and juicy for a delicious one pan chicken dinner.","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"1 hr 30 mins","totalTime":"1 hr 40 mins","yield":"6 servings","ingredients":["1 (4 pound) whole chicken","1 tablespoon avocado oil","1 tablespoon olive oil","salt and freshly ground black pepper to taste","cooking twine","4.5 cups peeled, sliced potatoes, about 1/8 inch thick","1 tablespoon olive oil","1 teaspoon minced fresh rosemary","rosemary sprigs for garnish (optional)"],"instructions":["Place a 10-inch cast iron skillet on the center rack of a cold oven.","Preheat the oven and skillet to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C).","While the oven is heating, remove any giblets from the chicken, and discard or reserve for stock.","Season the inside of the chicken with salt and pepper. Fold the tips of the wings under the neck area of the chicken, and tie the legs together with cooking twine.","Combine avocado oil and olive oil in a small bowl and brush the outside of the chicken with the combined oils. Reserve any unused oil. Season the outside of the chicken with salt and pepper.","Carefully place the hot skillet on a heat-safe surface (e.g. your stove) and brush the inside of the skillet with the remaining reserved oils.","Place the chicken on its side in the skillet, with the leg quarter coming in contact with the hot skilled. Return the skillet to the oven and roast for 25 to 30 minutes.","Combine sliced potatoes, 1 tablespoon olive oil, minced rosemary, salt, and pepper in a bowl and mix well.","After the chicken has roasted on one side, place hot skillet on a cutting board, turn the chicken to the other side, and add potato mixture to half of the skillet. Roast for 25 to 30 minutes.","Carefully pull skillet out of the oven and return to the cutting board. Lift chicken slightly and spread the potatoes over the whole skillet. Place chicken, breast side up, on top of the potatoes. Roast until the chicken is no longer pink at the bone and the juiced run clear, 25 to 30 minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the thickest part of the thigh, near the bone, should read 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).","Turn off the oven and allow the chicken to rest inside the oven about 5 to 10 minutes. This will keep the skin nice and crispy.","Garnish with fresh rosemary sprigs, carve the chicken, and serve the chicken and potatoes from the skillet."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/givMVwViN1a0d6KMWn9g7Ll60Wg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/1661128546Roast20Chicken20and20Potatoes20in20Cast20Iron-242482c2c21e4bf68f7c4e2da4c63857.jpeg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/260386/caveman-chili/","title":"Caveman Chili","categories":["Want to Try"],"description":"This slow-cooker, low-carb chili recipe is for the keto caveman in you with pork, bacon, green bell peppers, tomatoes, onion, and spices.","prepTime":"20 mins","cookTime":"6 hrs 15 mins","totalTime":"6 hrs 35 mins","yield":"8 servings","ingredients":["2 pounds ground pork","8 thick slices bacon, chopped","1 (14.5 ounce) can diced tomatoes, drained","1 onion, chopped","3 small green bell peppers, chopped","1 (6 ounce) can tomato paste","1 (1.25 ounce) package chili seasoning (such as McCormick)","1 pinch garlic powder, or more to taste","1 pinch onion powder, or more to taste","salt and ground black pepper to taste","1 pinch ground cayenne pepper, or more to taste"],"instructions":["Place pork in a skillet over medium heat; season with salt and pepper. Cook and stir until browned and crumbly, 5 to 7 minutes. Drain and discard grease. Transfer pork to a slow cooker.","Place bacon in the hot skillet and cook over medium-high heat until evenly brown, about 10 minutes. Drain and discard grease. Transfer bacon to the slow cooker.","Combine drained tomatoes, onion, green bell pepper, and tomato paste in the slow cooker. Add seasoning packet, garlic powder, onion powder, salt, pepper, and cayenne pepper; stir to combine.","Cook on Low until flavors have combined, about 6 hours."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lsvBn9OE3Ngp7r7lu5N7uskSPm8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/4578565-caveman-chili-France-C-4x3-1-07c4dc94b9f54f51900415fc1b334b0b.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/260607/basic-keto-cheese-crisps/","title":"Cheese Crisps","categories":["Keto"],"description":"These baked cheese crisps are a quick, easy, and delicious 1-ingredient crunchy snack that are naturally low-carb, gluten-free, and keto-friendly.","prepTime":"5 mins","cookTime":"10 mins","totalTime":"20 mins","yield":"24 crisps","ingredients":["1 cup shredded Cheddar cheese"],"instructions":["Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Line 2 baking sheets with parchment paper.","Shred generous amounts cheese.","Arrange cheese in 24 small heaps on the prepared baking sheets.","Bake in the preheated oven until golden brown, about 7 minutes. Cool for 5 to 10 minutes before removing from baking sheets."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/V5xp1W9utHTkDWEMQPq-kjOaK2E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/260607-Basic-Keto-Cheese-Crisps-4x3-16-429252fcf13543f1bc596ef0887cd45b.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/229150/cheesy-amish-breakfast-casserole/","title":"Cheesy Amish Breakfast Casserole","categories":["Breakfast"],"description":"This Amish breakfast casserole has bacon, onion, hash browns, eggs, and 3 types of cheese baked into a hearty, comforting dish—perfect for a crowd.","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"55 mins","totalTime":"1 hr 15 mins","yield":"12 servings (1 9x13-inch casserole)","ingredients":["1 pound sliced bacon, diced","1 medium sweet onion, chopped","9 large eggs, lightly beaten","4 cups frozen shredded hash brown potatoes, thawed","2 cups shredded Cheddar cheese","1.5 cups small curd cottage cheese","1.25 cups shredded Swiss cheese"],"instructions":["Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a 9x13-inch baking dish.","Heat a large skillet over medium-high heat; cook and stir bacon and onion until bacon is evenly browned, about 10 minutes. Drain.","Transfer bacon and onion to a large bowl. Stir in eggs, potatoes, Cheddar cheese, cottage cheese, and Swiss cheese.","Pour mixture into the prepared baking dish.","Bake in the preheated oven until eggs are set and cheese is melted, 45 to 50 minutes. Let stand 10 minutes before cutting and serving."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NwW--lk2SUJDcqIKsf7uZT95Vlw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229150-cheesy-amish-breakfast-casserole-VAT-014-4x3-C-62d6117a7791429fa747326353421891.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/67132/cheesy-creamed-spinach/","title":"Cheesy Creamed Spinach","categories":["Want to Try"],"description":"This creamed spinach recipe uses fresh spinach, garlic, heavy cream, provolone, and Parmesan cheese for a deliciously rich and creamy side dish.","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"20 mins","totalTime":"30 mins","yield":"10 servings","ingredients":["3 (10 ounce) bags clean fresh spinach, roughly chopped","0.25 cup butter","3 tablespoons minced white onion","2 tablespoons minced garlic","1.25 cups heavy cream","6 slices provolone cheese","0.5 cup freshly grated Parmesan cheese","salt and pepper to taste"],"instructions":["Gather all ingredients.","Heat a large skillet over medium-high heat. Add spinach; cook and stir until wilted.","Drain in a colander, squeezing out as much liquid as possible.","Melt butter in the same skillet over medium heat. Add onion and garlic; cook and stir until tender, about 5 minutes.","Add spinach and stir in heavy cream.","Tear provolone cheese into small pieces and lay on top of spinach mixture. Stir until cheese is melted and coats spinach.","Stir in Parmesan cheese. Continue to cook and stir until thickened.","Season with salt and pepper; serve hot."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mJPLcTThnrQCE9zJKzCP2f_vlfY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-67132-CheesyCreamedSpinach-ddmfs-Step7-3x4-6639-da6664793e0b4e1ba0f0d2ad7179cdbf.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/275489/chef-johns-american-goulash/","title":"Chef John's American Goulash","categories":["Beef"],"description":"This American goulash is a one-pot, cafeteria-style mix of ground beef, macaroni, and a seasoned tomato sauce. It's the comfort food of your childhood!","prepTime":"15 mins","cookTime":"1 hr 5 mins","totalTime":"1 hr 25 mins","yield":"12 servings","ingredients":["1 tablespoon olive oil","2 pounds ground beef","1 large onion, diced","4 cloves garlic, minced","2 large bay leaves","2 tablespoons paprika","2 teaspoons Italian seasoning","2 teaspoons kosher salt","0.5 teaspoon ground black pepper","1 pinch cayenne pepper, or to taste","1 quart chicken broth","1 (24 ounce) jar marinara sauce","1 (15 ounce) can diced tomatoes","1 cup water","2 tablespoons soy sauce","2 cups elbow macaroni","0.25 cup chopped Italian parsley","1 cup shredded white Cheddar cheese"],"instructions":["Gather all ingredients.","Heat oil in a pot over medium-high heat. Add ground beef and onion; cook and stir until beef is browned and crumbly and onion is translucent, about 5 minutes. Continue to cook and stir until liquid is evaporated, 3 to 5 minutes. Add garlic, bay leaves, paprika, Italian seasoning, salt, black pepper, and cayenne.","Cook, stirring occasionally, until flavors come together, about 3 minutes. Pour in broth, marinara sauce, and diced tomatoes. Pour water into the sauce jar, swirl, and pour into the pot. Stir in soy sauce; bring to a simmer. Reduce the heat to medium and simmer until flavors intensify, about 30 minutes.","Increase the heat to medium-high and bring to a rapid simmer. Stir in macaroni; cook, stirring occasionally, until just barely tender, about 12 minutes. Check for doneness after 10 minutes.","Remove from the heat and discard bay leaves. Stir in Cheddar and parsley. Cover and let rest for 5 minutes. Taste and season as desired."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/T3rL7cHaraOUKxjIfqSx6GcjvGY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/JF_275489_ChefJohnsAmericanGoulash_4x3_13361-0bec55d8f2ea474a9bf4af7fb0a01ec1.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/220128/chef-johns-buttermilk-fried-chicken/","title":"Chef John's Buttermilk Fried Chicken","categories":["Chicken"],"description":"Buttermilk fried chicken that's crispy and tender. Whole chicken pieces are soaked in buttermilk, coated in seasoned flour, then fried until crisp.","prepTime":"15 mins","cookTime":"25 mins","totalTime":"6 hrs 50 mins","yield":"4 servings (8 pieces)","ingredients":["1 (3 1/2) pound chicken, cut into 8 pieces","1 teaspoon black pepper","1 teaspoon salt","1 teaspoon paprika","0.5 teaspoon white pepper","0.25 teaspoon dried rosemary","0.25 teaspoon ground thyme","0.25 teaspoon dried oregano","0.25 teaspoon dried sage","0.25 teaspoon cayenne pepper","2 cups buttermilk","2 cups flour","1 teaspoon salt","0.5 teaspoon paprika","0.5 teaspoon cayenne pepper","0.5 teaspoon garlic powder","0.5 teaspoon white pepper","0.5 teaspoon onion powder","2.5 quarts peanut oil for frying"],"instructions":["Gather all ingredients.","Toss chicken pieces, black pepper, salt, paprika, white pepper, rosemary, thyme, oregano, sage, and cayenne together in a large bowl.","Stir in buttermilk until chicken is evenly coated. Cover and refrigerate for 6 hours.","Combine flour, salt, paprika, cayenne, garlic powder, white pepper, and onion powder in a large shallow dish.","Remove chicken from buttermilk and dredge each piece in seasoned flour; shake off any excess and transfer to a plate.","Heat peanut oil in a large Dutch oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).","Add chicken pieces to the hot oil and fry for 10 minutes. Turn chicken pieces and fry for another 10 to 15 minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted near the bone should read 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).","Transfer fried chicken to a cooling rack set over a paper towel-lined baking sheet. Let sit for 10 minutes before serving.","Enjoy!"],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vhU1HC9EdWxWQIXjrN5UnmxlV7Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/220128-chef-johns-buttermilk-fried-chicken-032-4x3-4880a8665b4b4f008d108728111923ea.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/255588/chef-johns-chicken-a-la-king/","title":"Chef John's Chicken a la King","categories":["Chicken"],"description":"This classic comfort food recipe is easy to adapt to your taste. Use leftover roast chicken or a store-bought rotisserie chicken, and serve the creamy sauce over pasta, toast, rice, or mashed potatoes.","prepTime":"15 mins","cookTime":"30 mins","totalTime":"45 mins","yield":"4 servings","ingredients":["6 tablespoons unsalted butter","0.5 pound sliced mushrooms","2 large shallots, minced","1 cup diced sweet bell peppers","Salt and freshly ground black pepper to taste","1/3 cup all-purpose flour","0.25 cup dry sherry","3.5 cups chicken stock or broth","1 pinch freshly grated nutmeg","1 pinch cayenne pepper","2 teaspoons fresh thyme","1 tablespoon chopped fresh Italian parsley","1/3 cup creme fraiche or heavy cream","4 cups cubed roasted chicken","Chopped fresh chives for garnish"],"instructions":["Melt butter in a large skillet over medium-high heat. Add mushrooms and salt. Saute until mushrooms release their moisture. Continue cooking until moisture evaporates and mushrooms begin to brown, 8 to 10 minutes. Add shallots; cook and stir just until shallots soften, 3 or 4 minutes.","Reduce heat to medium. Stir in flour to coat the mushrooms; cook until flour begins to turn golden, about 5 minutes, to form roux. Add peppers; cook and stir about 1 minute. Pour in sherry wine; allow to sizzle about 30 seconds. Stir in stock. Raise heat to medium-high and bring to a simmer. When it starts to bubble, reduce heat to medium-low and cook until slightly thickened, 10 to 15 minutes stirring occasionally. Add nutmeg and cayenne pepper.","Stir in thyme, parsley, cream, and chicken. Reduce heat to low and cook until chicken is heated through, about 5 minutes. Check seasonings and adjust as needed. Top each serving with some chopped fresh chives."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EANEP61VZjyg094Err5_T4BBMiQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/3983206-chef-johns-chicken-a-la-king-Chef-John-1x1-1-f95af368fcb043d981b12dce2b54da07.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/220059/chef-johns-classic-beef-stroganoff/","title":"Chef John's Classic Beef Stroganoff","categories":["Beef"],"description":"This classic beef stroganoff recipe is made rich with chuck roast, mushrooms, and white wine. Crème fraîche adds a deliciously creamy finishing touch.","prepTime":"15 mins","cookTime":"1 hr 30 mins","totalTime":"1 hr 45 mins","yield":"8 servings","ingredients":["2 pounds beef chuck roast, cut into 1/2-inch thick strips","salt and pepper to taste","1 tablespoon vegetable oil","8 ounces sliced mushrooms","0.5 medium onion, sliced or diced","1 tablespoon butter","2 cloves garlic, minced","1.5 tablespoons all-purpose flour","0.5 cup white wine","2 cups beef broth, divided","0.75 cup creme fraiche","1 tablespoon fresh chopped chives","salt and pepper to taste"],"instructions":["Season beef generously with salt and pepper.","Heat oil in a large skillet over high heat until nearly smoking. Stir in beef; cook, stirring constantly, for 6 to 7 minutes, until liquid evaporates and meat browns.","Remove meat from the pan and set aside. Stir mushrooms, onions, and butter into the pan; cook and stir over medium heat until vegetables are lightly browned.","Add garlic and stir for 30 seconds. Stir in flour; cook for 1 to 2 minutes until incorporated. Stir in wine and 1 cup of broth, scraping the bottom of the pan to release any browned bits. Bring to a simmer and cook until the sauce thickens, about 3 to 4 minutes.","Return beef to the pan. Stir in remaining cup of broth; bring to a simmer and cook on low heat for about 1 hour, covered, until beef is tender and sauce is thick. Stir every 20 minutes.","Stir in crème fraîche. Stir in chives. Season with salt and pepper to taste.","Serve hot and enjoy!"],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ql4hTdhKYV1eifgS3nShSdSk63I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/220059-ChefJohnsClassicBeefStroganoff-mfs-2X3-0032-ee04ff133b334abd98040199454a137a.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/220416/chef-johns-homemade-chicken-noodle-soup/","title":"Chef John's Homemade Chicken Noodle Soup","categories":["Soups"],"description":"This homemade chicken noodle soup is Chef John's soul-warming and deliciously simple recipe that uses a flavorful homemade roasted chicken stock.","prepTime":"20 mins","cookTime":"20 mins","totalTime":"40 mins","yield":"8 servings","ingredients":["1 tablespoon butter","0.5 cup diced carrot","0.5 cup diced onion","0.5 cup diced celery","0.25 teaspoon fresh thyme leaves","1 pinch salt","2 tablespoons melted chicken fat","2 quarts roasted chicken broth (see footnote for recipe link)","4 ounces uncooked wide egg noodles","2 cooked boneless chicken breast halves, cubed","1 pinch cayenne pepper","salt and ground black pepper to taste"],"instructions":["Melt butter in a large soup pot over medium heat. Stir in carrot, onion, celery, thyme, and salt. Add chicken fat; cook and stir until onions turn soft and translucent, 5 to 6 minutes.","Stir in roasted chicken broth and bring to a boil. Season with salt, if necessary.","Stir in egg noodles; cook until tender, about 5 minutes.","Add cooked chicken breast meat; simmer until heated through, about 5 minutes. Season with cayenne pepper, salt, and black pepper.","Serve hot and enjoy!"],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/56pjTgfG_l13xQ5g5bzb0wtELpM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/220416-chef-johns-homemade-chicken-noodle-soup-DDMFS-4x3-8afe771a58604367a7357af555399332.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/220854/chef-johns-italian-meatballs/","title":"Chef John's Italian Meatballs","categories":["Beef"],"description":"These Italian meatballs use a delicious mix of ground beef and pork and get added flavor from garlic, Italian herb seasoning, and Parmesan cheese.","prepTime":"20 mins","cookTime":"35 mins","totalTime":"2 hr 15 mins","yield":"8 servings","ingredients":["0.33333334326744 cup plain bread crumbs","0.5 cup milk","2 tablespoons olive oil","1 onion, diced","1 pound ground beef","1 pound ground pork","2 eggs","2 tablespoons grated Parmesan cheese","0.25 bunch fresh parsley, chopped","3 cloves garlic, crushed","2 teaspoons salt","1 teaspoon ground black pepper","1 teaspoon dried Italian herb seasoning","0.5 teaspoon red pepper flakes"],"instructions":["Gather all ingredients.","Cover a baking sheet with foil and spray lightly with cooking spray. Soak bread crumbs in milk in a small bowl for 20 minutes.","Meanwhile, heat olive oil in a skillet over medium heat. Add onion; cook and stir until onion has softened and turned translucent, about 5 minutes. Reduce heat to low and continue cooking and stirring until onion is very tender, about 15 minutes more.","Gently stir beef and pork together in a large bowl. Add onions, bread crumb mixture, eggs, Parmesan cheese, parsley, garlic, salt, black pepper, Italian herb seasoning, and red pepper flakes; mix together using a rubber spatula until combined. Cover and refrigerate for about one hour.","Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C).","Form mixture into balls about 1 ½ inches in diameter; arrange in a single layer on the prepared baking sheet.","Bake in the preheated oven until browned and cooked through, 15 to 20 minutes.","Serve with your favorite tomato sauce. Enjoy!"],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bA6K66Wfj2oyXQtnZob8FP-UFU8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/220854-chef-johns-italian-meatballs-DDMFS-beauty-4x3-BG-31732-f527165240e34fb081a5290e47d580d0.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/219077/chef-johns-perfect-mashed-potatoes/","title":"Chef John's Perfect Mashed Potatoes","categories":["Side"],"description":"Chef John's perfect mashed potatoes recipe, made with russet potatoes, milk, and lots of butter, turns out smooth, fluffy, and lump-free every time.","prepTime":"20 mins","cookTime":"25 mins","totalTime":"45 mins","yield":"4 servings","ingredients":["3 large russet potatoes, peeled and cut in half lengthwise","0.5 cup whole milk","0.25 cup butter","salt and ground black pepper to taste"],"instructions":["Place potatoes in a large pot and cover with cold salted water by about 1 inch. Bring to a boil. Reduce heat to medium-low, cover and simmer until tender and easily pierced with a fork, 20 to 25 minutes.","Drain potatoes and return to the pot. Set the pot over high heat; let potatoes cook until excess moisture evaporates, about 30 seconds. Remove from the heat.","Mash potatoes with a potato masher until mostly smooth; mash in milk and butter until smooth and fluffy.","Season with salt and pepper; whisk until evenly distributed, about 15 seconds."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CUiS70VZhyMRqEo1U7tPAc4vm-Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/219077-chef-johns-perfect-mashed-potatoes-DDMFS-step-05-98191b0582bb4a428d47bf49ec4bdb20.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/47688/chicken-marsala-florentine/","title":"Chicken Marsala Florentine","categories":["Want to Try"],"description":"This is a gorgeous chicken dish with sun-dried tomatoes, spinach, and mushrooms. It is so wonderful when served with garlic mashed potatoes. It tastes fantastic!","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"25 mins","totalTime":"35 mins","yield":"4 servings","ingredients":["4 boneless, skinless chicken breast halves","0.25 cup all-purpose flour","salt and pepper to taste","1 tablespoon dried oregano","2 tablespoons olive oil","0.75 cup butter","3 cups sliced portobello mushrooms","0.75 cup sun-dried tomatoes","0.5 cup packed fresh spinach","1 cup Marsala wine"],"instructions":["Place chicken breasts between two pieces of wax paper, and pound to 1/4 inch thick with a meat mallet. Dust chicken with flour, salt, pepper and oregano.","In a skillet, fry chicken in olive oil over medium heat. Cook until done, turning to cook evenly. Set aside, and keep warm.","In the same pan, melt the butter over medium heat; add mushrooms, sun-dried tomatoes, and Marsala wine. Cook for approximately 10 minutes, stirring occasionally. Mix in spinach, and cook for about 2 minutes. Serve over chicken."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/POWg-4x8_6VvXJRyM94mvlzI7Uo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/1319949-f3eef618aa2e4bf793f5f0d351d8fcb3.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/223042/chicken-parmesan/","title":"Chicken Parmesan","categories":["Main - Everyday","Chicken"],"description":"For the best chicken Parmesan, try Chef John's version that's pan-fried and then baked, delivering impressive results with a crispier crust than most recipes.","prepTime":"15 mins","cookTime":"20 mins","totalTime":"45 mins","yield":"4 servings","ingredients":["4 skinless, boneless chicken breast halves","salt and freshly ground black pepper to taste","2 large eggs","1 cup panko bread crumbs, or more as needed","3/4 cup grated Parmesan cheese, divided","2 tablespoons all-purpose flour, or more if needed","1/2 cup olive oil for frying, or as needed","1/2 cup prepared tomato sauce","1/4 cup fresh mozzarella, cut into small cubes","1/4 cup chopped fresh basil","1/2 cup grated provolone cheese","2 teaspoons olive oil"],"instructions":["Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 450 degrees F (230 degrees C).","Place chicken breasts between two sheets of heavy plastic (resealable freezer bags work well) on a solid, level surface. Firmly pound chicken with the smooth side of a meat mallet to a thickness of 1/2-inch.","Season chicken thoroughly with salt and pepper. Using a sifter or strainer, sprinkle flour over chicken breasts, evenly coating both sides.","Beat eggs in a shallow bowl and set aside. Mix bread crumbs and 1/2 cup Parmesan cheese in a separate bowl, set aside. Dip a flour-coated chicken breast in beaten eggs. Transfer breast to the bread crumb mixture, pressing crumbs into both sides. Repeat for each breast. Let chicken rest for 10 to 15 minutes.","Heat 1/2 inch of olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat until it begins to shimmer. Cook chicken in batches, so you do not overcrowd the pan, until golden, about 2 minutes per side. The chicken will finish cooking in the oven.","Transfer chicken to a baking dish. Top each breast with 2 tablespoons tomato sauce. Layer each chicken breast with equal amounts of mozzarella cheese, fresh basil, and provolone cheese. Sprinkle remaining Parmesan over top and drizzle each with 1/2 teaspoon olive oil.","Bake in the preheated oven until cheese is browned and bubbly and chicken breasts are no longer pink in the center, 15 to 20 minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read at least 165 degrees F (74 degrees C). Let chicken rest briefly before serving."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/J0U0wHxsY1r-I1JUJ5jXcwCnzRI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/223042-Chicken-Parmesan-mfs_001-7ab952346edc4b2da36f3c0259b78543.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/19368/chucks-favorite-mac-and-cheese/","title":"Chuck's Favorite Mac and Cheese","categories":["Want to Try"],"description":"This mac and cheese with cottage cheese, shredded Cheddar, and grated Parmesan is topped with a buttery breaded topping. It's super cheesy and delicious!","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"45 mins","totalTime":"55 mins","yield":"6 servings (1 (9x13-inch) casserole)","ingredients":["1 (8 ounce) package elbow macaroni","1 cup dry bread crumbs","0.25 cup butter, melted","1 (12 ounce) container small curd cottage cheese","1 (8 ounce) package shredded sharp Cheddar cheese","1 (8 ounce) container sour cream","0.25 cup grated Parmesan cheese","salt and pepper to taste"],"instructions":["Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a 9x13-inch baking dish.","Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Cook elbow macaroni in the boiling water, stirring occasionally, until tender yet firm to the bite, about 8 minutes. Drain.","Mix bread crumbs and melted butter together in a small bowl.","Transfer drained macaroni to the prepared baking dish. Add cottage cheese, Cheddar, sour cream, Parmesan, salt, and pepper; stir until well combined. Sprinkle bread crumb mixture over top.","Bake in the preheated oven until golden brown on top, 30 to 35 minutes."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QN9Zab9kOjJgKZZekDhOstqNREQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/231415-chucks-favorite-mac-and-cheese-Chefbound-1x1-1-00da676f5b364ccf8099a121b18abfbb.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/14415/cobb-salad/","title":"Cobb Salad","categories":["Keto"],"description":"This Cobb salad is packed with crispy bacon, hard-boiled eggs, chicken, tomatoes, creamy blue cheese, avocado, and green onion — what's not to love?","prepTime":"20 mins","cookTime":"10 mins","totalTime":"30 mins","yield":"6 servings","ingredients":["6 slices bacon","3 eggs","1 head iceberg lettuce, shredded","3 cups chopped, cooked chicken meat","2 tomatoes, seeded and chopped","3/4 cup blue cheese, crumbled","3 green onions, chopped","1 avocado - peeled, pitted and diced","1 (8 ounce) bottle Ranch-style salad dressing"],"instructions":["Place eggs in a saucepan and cover completely with cold water; bring to a boil, then cover and remove from heat. Let eggs sit for 10 to 12 minutes, then cool, peel and chop.","While the eggs are cooking, place bacon in a large, deep skillet. Cook over medium-high heat until evenly brown, 7 to 10 minutes. Drain, crumble, and set aside.","Divide shredded lettuce among individual plates. Arrange rows of bacon, eggs, chicken, tomatoes, blue cheese, green onions, and avocado on top.","Drizzle with dressing and enjoy!"],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lUCXnzWTl9WOQ9NRAT08hA4O2lE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14415-cobb-salad-DDMFS-4x3-608ba9c5768b49079eb75fe9a9898307.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/13643/cranberry-sauce-extraordinaire/","title":"Cranberry Sauce Extraordinaire","categories":["Thanksgiving"],"description":"The best cranberry sauce recipe combines fresh cranberries, orange, apple, pear, dried fruit, pecans, and spices to make a classic holiday side dish.","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"35 mins","totalTime":"45 mins","yield":"12 servings","ingredients":["1 cup water","1 cup white sugar","1 (12 ounce) package fresh cranberries","1 orange, peeled and pureed","1 apple - peeled, cored and diced","1 pear - peeled, cored and diced","1 cup chopped dried mixed fruit","1 cup chopped pecans","0.5 teaspoon salt","1 teaspoon ground cinnamon","0.5 teaspoon ground nutmeg"],"instructions":["Bring water and sugar to a boil in a medium saucepan until sugar dissolves. Reduce heat and stir in cranberries, pureed orange, apple, pear, dried fruit, pecans, salt, cinnamon, and nutmeg. Cover, and simmer for 30 minutes, stirring occasionally, until cranberries burst. Remove from heat, and let cool to room temperature."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PqoNDKUqkiywKW-SYZWHbunVYuA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/2907429-cranberry-sauce-extraordinaire-Elizabeth-4x3-1-b324d62d29484113a2ae92ef5dbb0c9f.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/23852/creamy-chicken-and-wild-rice-soup/","title":"Creamy Chicken and Wild Rice Soup","categories":["Soups"],"description":"This wild rice and chicken soup is quick, easy, and comforting. Instant rice is cooked in chicken broth with shredded chicken and finished with cream.","prepTime":"5 mins","cookTime":"30 mins","totalTime":"35 mins","yield":"8 servings","ingredients":["2 cooked, boneless chicken breast halves, shredded","4 cups chicken broth","2 cups water","1 (4.5 ounce) package quick cooking long grain and wild rice with seasoning packet","0.75 cup all-purpose flour","0.5 teaspoon salt","0.5 teaspoon ground black pepper","0.5 cup butter","2 cups heavy cream"],"instructions":["Combine chicken, broth, and water in a large pot over medium heat. Bring to a boil, then stir in rice, reserving the seasoning packet. Cover and remove from heat.","Combine flour, salt, and pepper in a small bowl.","Melt butter in a medium saucepan over medium heat. Stir in contents of seasoning packet until mixture is bubbly. Reduce heat to low, then add flour mixture, a few tablespoons at a time, into the butter mixture, stirring continuously to form a roux. Whisk in cream, a little at a time, until fully incorporated and smooth. Cook until thickened, about 5 minutes.","Stir flour and cream mixture into broth and rice. Cook over medium heat until heated through, 10 to 15 minutes.","Serve hot and enjoy!"],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vJlE5eOHyD73BF911GRm7YeLPCw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/23852-creamy-chicken-and-wild-rice-soup-DDMFS-4x3-15edf46c49ba42ad897a077a320a66b0.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/264017/creamy-keto-taco-soup-with-ground-beef/","title":"Creamy Keto Taco Soup with Ground Beef","categories":["Keto"],"description":"This keto taco soup with ground beef, tomatoes, onion, cumin, garlic, and chili powder is thickened with cream cheese for a satisfying low-carb meal.","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"20 mins","totalTime":"30 mins","yield":"8 servings","ingredients":["1 pound ground beef","1/2 cup chopped onion","2 cloves garlic, minced","1 tablespoon ground cumin","1 teaspoon chili powder","1 (8 ounce) package cream cheese, softened","2 (14.5 ounce) cans beef broth","2 (10 ounce) cans diced tomatoes and green chiles (such as RO*TEL®)","1/2 cup heavy cream","2 teaspoons salt, or to taste"],"instructions":["Gather all ingredients.","Combine ground beef with onion and garlic in a large soup pot over medium-high heat. Cook and stir until beef is browned and crumbly, 5 to 7 minutes.","Drain and discard grease. Add cumin and chili powder; cook 2 minutes more.","Drop cream cheese into the pot by bits and mash it into the beef with a big spoon until no white spots remain, 3 to 5 minutes.","Stir in broth, diced tomatoes and green chiles, heavy cream, and salt. Cook until heated through, about 10 minutes more."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/O9EO8Z7hflHIgTF0yp7zOoqRE8w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-264017-CreamyKetoTacoSoupwithGroundBeef-ddmfs-3x4-5768-029914982d6b492c9fbb1efc8ecbfb7e.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/281802/creamy-white-chicken-chili-with-salsa-verde/","title":"Creamy White Chicken Chili with Salsa Verde","categories":["Keto"],"description":"Salsa verde and jalapeno peppers really raise the temperature of this creamy white chicken chili recipe.","prepTime":"30 mins","cookTime":"1 hr 15 mins","totalTime":"1 hr 45 mins","yield":"10 servings","ingredients":["1 (8 ounce) package cream cheese, softened","1/2 cup half-and-half","1 tablespoon olive oil","2 medium green bell peppers, chopped","2 medium jalapeno peppers, diced","3 cloves garlic, chopped","1 (2 pound) rotisserie chicken, skinned and boned, meat pulled into large chunks","1 tablespoon dried minced shallots","1/4 teaspoon cayenne pepper","salt and ground black pepper to taste","8 cups chicken stock","1 (16 ounce) jar salsa verde","1 tablespoon ground cumin","2 teaspoons dried oregano"],"instructions":["Place cream cheese in a microwave-safe bowl. Microwave on high power until soft, about 20 seconds. Stir in half-and-half until combined; set aside.","Heat oil in a large skillet over medium heat. Add bell peppers, jalapeños, and garlic; sauté until soft, 5 to 7 minutes. Stir in chicken, dried shallots, cayenne pepper, salt, and black pepper. Add cream cheese mixture, chicken stock, salsa, cumin, and oregano; bring to a boil.","Reduce heat; simmer for 1 to 2 hours."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ulqwLTycTe2kaMfeg0ihJGuabt4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/5197437-556569c781bb4ec8b1abb5b5ae1ace05.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/276218/crunchy-baked-pesto-chicken-thighs/","title":"Crunchy Baked Pesto Chicken Thighs","categories":["Want to Try"],"description":"Try these easy and delicious baked chicken thighs that are breaded with pesto, panko bread crumbs, and Parmesan cheese.","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"20 mins","totalTime":"30 mins","yield":"4 servings","ingredients":["0.5 cup panko bread crumbs","0.5 cup Parmesan cheese, grated","0.5 tablespoon olive oil","0.25 teaspoon salt","0.25 teaspoon pepper","1 pound boneless, skinless chicken thighs","3 tablespoons prepared pesto"],"instructions":["Preheat the oven to 450 degrees F (230 degrees C). Line a baking sheet with parchment paper.","Combine panko, Parmesan cheese, olive oil, salt, and pepper in a bowl.","Place chicken thighs onto the prepared baking sheet and coat each side with pesto. Press panko mixture onto chicken.","Bake in the preheated oven until chicken is no longer pink in the center and the juices run clear, about 20 minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read at least 165 degrees F (74 degrees C)."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/btftwTSAfRzKGO4LPE141r1H1Hc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/Crunchy-Baked-Pesto-Chicken-Thighs-My-Hot-Southern-Mess-4x3-1-3edcc1bc4995490b86e40ef97c3c0355.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/147103/delicious-egg-salad-for-sandwiches/","title":"Delicious Egg Salad","categories":["Want to Try"],"description":"This egg salad recipe is easy to make with hard-boiled eggs, mayo, green onions, and mustard for a deliciously creamy salad perfect for sandwiches.","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"15 mins","totalTime":"35 mins","yield":"4 servings","ingredients":["8 eggs","0.5 cup mayonnaise","0.25 cup chopped green onion","1 teaspoon prepared yellow mustard","0.25 teaspoon paprika","salt and pepper to taste"],"instructions":["Gather all ingredients.","Place eggs in a saucepan and cover with cold water. Bring water to a boil and immediately remove from heat. Cover and let eggs stand in hot water for 10 to 12 minutes.","Remove eggs from hot water; cool, peel, and chop.","Place chopped eggs in a bowl; stir in mayonnaise, green onion, and mustard. Season with paprika, salt, and pepper.","Stir and serve on your favorite bread, crackers, or salad greens."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qI_4AEaIErnrnjInLNVA-vurWpA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-147103-delicious-egg-salad-for-sandwiches-DDMFS-4x3-ab3abdebb3c44c4fa45f64377002c990.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/20900/easter-breakfast-casserole/","title":"Easter Breakfast Casserole","categories":["Breakfast"],"description":"A delicious breakfast casserole with bacon and vegetables in the mix. This egg and hash brown breakfast dish is perfect for Easter brunch.","prepTime":"25 mins","cookTime":"1 hr 15 mins","totalTime":"1 hr 40 mins","yield":"12 servings (1 7x11-inch casserole)","ingredients":["cooking spray","1 pound bacon","8 large eggs","2 cups milk","3 cups shredded Cheddar cheese","0.25 cup diced onion","0.25 cup diced green bell pepper","1 (16 ounce) package frozen hash brown potatoes, thawed"],"instructions":["Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Lightly grease a 7x11-inch casserole dish.","Fry bacon in a large, deep skillet over medium-high heat until evenly browned, about 10 minutes. Drain on a paper towel-lined plate. Crumble.","Beat eggs and milk together in a large bowl; mix in cheese, bacon, onion, and green pepper. Stir in thawed hash browns. Pour mixture into prepared casserole.","Cover with aluminum foil and bake in preheated oven for 45 minutes. Uncover and bake until eggs have set, another 30 minutes."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9NfN-mWH2QxAghXy9ocTazXe1Ng=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/4556853-easter-breakfast-casserole-AllrecipesPhoto-1x1-1-3cba620ee76b4a328dbbf8ad1c51e776.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/264069/easy-asparagus-frittata/","title":"Easy Asparagus Frittata","categories":["Keto","Want to Try"],"description":"This asparagus frittata is easy to make with eggs, asparagus pieces, and Parmesan cheese for a great brunch dish or a quick dinner option.","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"20 mins","totalTime":"30 mins","yield":"4 servings","ingredients":["1 tablespoon olive oil","2 teaspoons butter","1/2 pound asparagus, trimmed, cut into 1-inch pieces","8 eggs","1/2 cup grated Parmesan cheese, or more to taste","7 tablespoons milk","salt and freshly ground black pepper to taste","1 tablespoon chopped fresh parsley"],"instructions":["Heat olive oil and butter in a 9-inch nonstick pan over medium heat and cook asparagus, stirring occasionally, until soft but still firm to the bite, 10 to 15 minutes.","Beat eggs in a bowl until frothy. Stir in Parmesan cheese and milk; season with salt and pepper. Pour egg mixture over asparagus and cook until eggs are set, 10 to 15 minutes.","Invert frittata onto a plate and garnish with parsley."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hnEWIM6Qcm7Bw5oZVj9DSnRRs_s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/264069-easy-asparagus-frittata-VAT-Beauty-4x3-7efa40cca1514e4c80d4349402fdc646.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/easy-bundt-pan-roasted-greek-chicken-and-vegetables-recipe-8600997/","title":"Easy Bundt Pan Roasted Greek Chicken and Vegetables","categories":["Chicken"],"description":"This easy Bundt pan roasted Greek chicken and vegetables gives incredible flavor to the potatoes, peppers, and carrots roasting below the whole, Greek-seasoned chicken, a whole new use for a Bundt pan. Add the fresh dill at the very end to maximize the bright herb's flavor.","prepTime":"20 mins","cookTime":"1 hr 10 mins","totalTime":"1 hr 30 mins","yield":"4 servings","ingredients":["nonstick cooking spray","2 pounds baby gold or red potatoes, cut into 1 1/2-inch pieces","1 red bell pepper, cut in 1 1/2- inch pieces","1 green bell pepper, cut into 1 1/2-inch pieces","1 large red onion, cut in 1 inch pieces","2 large carrots, peeled and cut in 1-inch pieces","2 Tablespoons olive oil","1/2 teaspoon kosher salt","1 Tablespoon Greek seasoning, divided","1/4 teaspoon freshly ground black Pepper","2 teaspoons Lemon zest, plus more for garnish if desired","1 (3 to 4 pound) whole chicken, cleaned and patted dry with paper towels","1/4 cup crumbled feta cheese","1 Tablespoon fresh dill (optional)"],"instructions":["Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Lightly coat a Bundt pan with cooking spray.","Add potatoes, red pepper, green pepper, onion, carrot, olive oil, salt, pepper, and 1 teaspoon Greek seasoning to a large bowl and toss well to coat. Add mixture to the bottom of the prepared Bundt pan.","Sprinkle chicken evenly with remaining Greek seasoning. Place chicken cavity over the Bundt pan center with legs facing down on top of the vegetables. Place Bundt pan on a rimmed baking sheet.","Bake in the preheated oven until chicken is no longer pink at the bone and the juices run clear, about 1 hour 10 minutes. Cover the top half with foil after 30 minutes to avoid over-browning. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the thickest part of the thigh, near the bone, should read 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).","Remove chicken to a serving platter or cutting board to rest for 5 to 10 minutes. Toss veggies with feta and dill, and serve with sliced chicken. Top with more lemon zest."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/stvG4bPf2VUyP4ZfEuEx03dmp-w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8600997-easy-bundt-pan-roasted-greek-chicken-and-vegetables-recipe-VAT-step-05-Cclosercropped-e103396c5dda4253aa35f40bad9591d5.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/261029/easy-low-carb-keto-broccoli-cheddar-soup/","title":"Easy Low-Carb Keto Broccoli Cheddar Soup","categories":["Keto"],"description":"This easy, low-carb, keto-friendly broccoli cheddar soup is so tasty and ideal for those winter nights that we all need some comfort food!","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"25 mins","totalTime":"35 mins","yield":"6 servings","ingredients":["1 teaspoon butter","3 cloves garlic, minced","2.5 cups vegetable broth","3 cups chopped broccoli","1 cup heavy whipping cream","3 cups shredded Cheddar cheese","2 slices bacon, chopped and cooked","salt and ground black pepper to taste"],"instructions":["Melt butter in a saucepan over medium heat. Cook garlic until tender, about 2 minutes. Add vegetable broth, heavy cream, and broccoli. Bring to a boil; simmer until broccoli is tender, about 15 minutes.","Add Cheddar cheese gradually, stirring constantly, until completely melted. Stir in bacon pieces. Season with salt and pepper."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MyGd2nMU8p9Go-HKpqtwTbzdV7E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/4572795-83ac00c7dc31494bbed5d640994e4729.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/241890/grilled-chicken-marinade/","title":"Grilled Chicken Marinade","categories":["Chicken"],"description":"This chicken marinade for grilled chicken is so flavorful and easy to prep with 3 main ingredients and simple seasonings for tender, juicy chicken every time!","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"10 mins","totalTime":"2 hrs 20 mins","yield":"5 servings","ingredients":["0.25 cup red wine vinegar","0.25 cup reduced-sodium soy sauce","0.25 cup olive oil","1.5 teaspoons dried parsley flakes","0.5 teaspoon dried basil","0.5 teaspoon dried oregano","0.25 teaspoon garlic powder","0.25 teaspoon ground black pepper","5 skinless, boneless chicken breasts, thinly sliced"],"instructions":["Gather all ingredients.","Whisk vinegar, soy sauce, olive oil, parsley, basil, oregano, garlic powder, and black pepper together in a bowl.","Pour into a resealable plastic bag. Add chicken, coat with the marinade, squeeze out excess air, and seal the bag. Marinate in the refrigerator, 2 to 4 hours.","Preheat grill for medium-low heat and lightly oil the grate. Drain and discard marinade.","Grill chicken on the preheated grill until no longer pink in the center, 4 to 5 minutes per side. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read at least 165 degrees F (74 degrees C)."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xNb_l8rpNkFB0i7MqcRjxgbmGoo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/241890-grilled-chicken-marinade-DDMFS-4x3-93bf452481e645808c72f13349340582.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/17897/hungarian-mushroom-soup/","title":"Hungarian Mushroom Soup","categories":["Want to Try"],"description":"This hearty Hungarian mushroom soup is seasoned generously with paprika, fresh parsley, and lemon juice. Sour cream makes it rich and creamy.","prepTime":"15 mins","cookTime":"35 mins","totalTime":"50 mins","yield":"6 servings","ingredients":["4 tablespoons unsalted butter","2 cups chopped onions","1 pound fresh mushrooms, sliced","2 cups chicken broth","1 tablespoon soy sauce","1 tablespoon paprika","2 teaspoons dried dill weed","1 cup milk","3 tablespoons all-purpose flour","0.5 cup sour cream","0.25 cup chopped fresh parsley","2 teaspoons lemon juice","1 teaspoon salt","ground black pepper to taste"],"instructions":["Gather the ingredients.","Melt butter in a large pot over medium heat. Add onions; cook and stir until softened, about 5 minutes. Add mushrooms and sauté for 5 more minutes. Stir in broth, soy sauce, paprika, and dill; reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer for 15 minutes.","Whisk milk and flour together in a separate bowl; stir into soup until blended. Cover and simmer for 15 more minutes, stirring occasionally.","Add sour cream, parsley, lemon juice, salt, and ground black pepper; stir over low heat until warmed through, about 3 to 5 minutes. Serve immediately."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/l8LfL_MtRrCVg4UH1Rvj7a3SuC0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17897-hungarian-mushroom-soup-ddmfs-3x4-185-be041a31c4ca4a5aa8c684774929b53c.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/17407/kabob-marinade/","title":"Kabob Marinade","categories":["Want to Try"],"description":"This tasty kabob marinade with soy sauce, lemon, Worcestershire, mustard, and garlic is easy to make and great for grilled beef or chicken kabobs.","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"","totalTime":"10 mins","yield":"6 servings (3 cups)","ingredients":["1 cup vegetable oil","0.75 cup soy sauce","0.5 cup lemon juice","0.25 cup Worcestershire sauce","0.25 cup prepared mustard","2 cloves garlic, minced","1.5 teaspoons coarsely cracked black pepper","1 teaspoon meat tenderizer"],"instructions":["Whisk oil, soy sauce, lemon juice, Worcestershire sauce, mustard, garlic, black pepper, and meat tenderizer together in a bowl until well combined."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vjK2FhcQrlWqmE3jJjDmiIKwCdc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/17407kabob-marinadeFranceC4x3-311d7a958a294e548017b5fad080b510.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/264206/keto-avocado-spinach-smoothie/","title":"Keto Avocado-Spinach Smoothie","categories":["Keto"],"description":"Here's the best keto smoothie on the internet: a no-fail, super-green blend of avocado and spinach, boosted with MCT oil, coconut milk, and vanilla powder.","prepTime":"5 mins","cookTime":"","totalTime":"5 mins","yield":"2 servings","ingredients":["1/2 cup coconut milk","1/2 cup water, or more as needed","ice cubes","1/2 medium avocado, pitted and scooped from shell","1/2 cup fresh spinach","2 tablespoons erythritol","1 tablespoon medium-chain triglyceride (MCT) oil","1/2 teaspoon vanilla powder"],"instructions":["Combine coconut milk, water, ice cubes, avocado, spinach, erythritol, MCT oil, and vanilla powder in a blender. Blend until smooth."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TgZ_t9m7IP7rKPWKPpVTWG6uapA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6839734-ad127e7cbfef439b86d9ea6ba0512f39.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/276622/keto-breakfast-frittata/","title":"Keto Breakfast Frittata","categories":["Breakfast"],"description":"This keto frittata is dressed up with lots of low-carb vegetables including bell peppers, spinach, and mushrooms for great flavor and texture.","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"30 mins","totalTime":"45 mins","yield":"6 servings (1 12-inch frittata)","ingredients":["4 ounces bulk breakfast sausage","8 eggs","2 tablespoons heavy cream","8 drops hot pepper sauce (such as Tabasco®), or more to taste","2 tablespoons butter","1 cup chopped mushrooms","0.66666668653488 cup chopped red bell pepper","0.5 cup chopped onion","salt and ground black pepper to taste","0.5 cup chopped fresh spinach","1 cup shredded Cheddar cheese"],"instructions":["Preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C).","Crumble sausage into a 12-inch nonstick, oven-proof skillet over medium heat. Cook until browned, about 4 minutes.","Meanwhile, whisk eggs in a large bowl. Add cream and hot pepper sauce; mix well.","Add butter to the skillet with browned sausage and melt around the inside rim of the skillet. Add mushrooms, red bell pepper, onion, salt, and pepper. Cook until onion is soft and translucent, about 4 minutes. Turn off heat and stir in spinach. Cook for 1 minute in the hot skillet, then sprinkle with Cheddar cheese. Pour egg mixture on top, making sure all ingredients are submerged.","Place skillet in the preheated oven and bake until eggs are set and no longer jiggle, about 20 minutes. Remove from oven and allow to sit for 1 to 2 minutes before cutting into serving pieces."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mBax6ikz7zym5W9xjMh_1wwGKog=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7164615-6ce3f59b4dbd46239c6b3a6304cc34c1.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/270281/keto-broccoli-salad/","title":"Keto Broccoli Salad","categories":["Salads","Want to Try"],"description":"This keto broccoli and cauliflower salad with bacon and a creamy dressing is filling enough to be a main dish.","prepTime":"25 mins","cookTime":"10 mins","totalTime":"1 hr 35 mins","yield":"4 servings","ingredients":["1 pound bacon","2 cups broccoli florets, chopped","2 cups cauliflower florets, chopped","1 carrot, chopped","0.25 cup chopped green onions","0.5 cup mayonnaise","0.25 cup distilled white vinegar","1 tablespoon sour cream","1 pinch garlic powder","1 pinch dried basil","0.25 cup shredded Cheddar cheese","1 tablespoon chopped fresh cilantro, or to taste"],"instructions":["Place bacon in a large skillet and cook over medium-high heat, turning occasionally, until evenly browned, about 10 minutes. Drain bacon slices on paper towels. Chop and set aside.","Combine broccoli, cauliflower, carrot, and green onions in a large bowl.","Combine mayonnaise, vinegar, and sour cream in a separate bowl. Beat until smooth. Season with garlic powder and basil.","Pour dressing over vegetables and toss to coat evenly. Chill until flavors meld, about 1 hour.","Serve salad garnished with Cheddar cheese and cilantro."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lgKiOAjM0EZnkV_12NtZgPVIm1c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/270281keto-broccoli-saladPaula4x3-db0ed7e471f247198a1f28f3c32d15da.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/259138/keto-chicken-parmesan/","title":"Keto Chicken Parmesan","categories":["Chicken","Want to Try"],"description":"A tasty, easy keto chicken Parmesan. Keep to your keto diet with this favorite Italian dish — chicken Parm is a perfect meal with veggies or salad.","prepTime":"20 mins","cookTime":"10 mins","totalTime":"30 mins","yield":"2 servings","ingredients":["1 (8 ounce) skinless, boneless chicken breast","1 large egg","1 tablespoon heavy whipping cream","1.5 ounces pork rinds, crushed","1 ounce grated Parmesan cheese","0.5 teaspoon salt","0.5 teaspoon garlic powder","0.5 teaspoon red pepper flakes","0.5 teaspoon ground black pepper","0.5 teaspoon Italian seasoning","1 tablespoon ghee (clarified butter)","0.5 cup jarred tomato sauce (such as Rao's)","0.25 cup shredded mozzarella cheese"],"instructions":["Set the oven rack about 6 inches from the heat source and preheat the oven's broiler.","Slice chicken breast through the middle horizontally from one side to within 1/2 inch of the other side. Open the two sides and spread them out like an open book. Pound chicken flat until about 1/2-inch thick.","Beat egg and cream together in a bowl.","Combine crushed pork rinds, Parmesan cheese, salt, garlic powder, red pepper, black pepper, and Italian seasoning in a separate shallow bowl or plate.","Dip chicken into egg mixture; coat completely. Press chicken into breading; thickly coat both sides.","Heat a skillet over medium-high heat; add ghee. Place chicken in the pan; cook until no longer pink in the center and the juices run clear, about 3 minutes per side. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read at least 165 degrees F (74 degrees C). Be careful to keep breading in place.","Transfer chicken to a baking sheet. Cover with tomato sauce; top with mozzarella cheese.","Broil until cheese is bubbling and barely browned, about 2 minutes."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NbuT36eBkH59GJ_siediyVM1U0c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/4560465-3642dd421df5431d97b43668a54d79aa.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/273165/keto-chicken-and-broccoli-casserole/","title":"Keto Chicken and Broccoli Casserole","categories":["Chicken","Want to Try"],"description":"This keto chicken and broccoli casserole is great for using up leftover chicken — both white and dark meat — for a tasty dinner the whole family will love.","prepTime":"20 mins","cookTime":"35 mins","totalTime":"55 mins","yield":"12 servings (1 9x13-inch casserole)","ingredients":["1 tablespoon extra virgin olive oil","2.5 cups cooked chicken, cut into bite-sized pieces","3 cups chopped, cooked broccoli","0.25 cup sliced almonds","4 tablespoons butter","1 cup heavy cream","0.5 (8 ounce) package cream cheese, cut into 1-inch cubes","4 ounces grated sharp Cheddar cheese","salt and ground black pepper to taste","0.75 cup crushed pork rinds"],"instructions":["Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).","Pour olive oil into a 9x13-inch baking dish and spread over the bottom and sides. Arrange cooked chicken in a single layer in the dish. Distribute cooked broccoli evenly over the chicken and sprinkle with almonds.","Melt butter in a saucepan over medium heat. Add cream; cook and stir for 1 to 2 minutes. Stir in cream cheese until melted and smooth, 2 to 3 minutes. Add Cheddar cheese and stir until melted, 2 to 3 minutes. Season with salt and pepper. Pour sauce over chicken, broccoli, and almonds; top with crushed pork rinds.","Bake in the preheated oven until sauce is bubbly, 25 to 30 minutes."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2fl-M9x9Ss6KVtKeJhHuRkTSoNI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6594551-a45db11145a249ee928b7dbc7405043b.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/268690/keto-coconut-cookies/","title":"Keto Coconut Cookies","categories":["Keto"],"description":"You can enjoy these coconut almond cookies even if you're cutting down on carbs or following a keto diet.","prepTime":"15 mins","cookTime":"17 mins","totalTime":"35 mins","yield":"18 cookies","ingredients":["3/4 cup granular sucralose sweetener (such as Splenda®)","1/2 cup butter","3 eggs","1/2 tablespoon heavy cream","1 teaspoon almond milk","1/2 cup unsweetened coconut flakes","6 tablespoons coconut flour","1/4 cup almond flour","1 teaspoon baking powder","1 teaspoon baking soda","1/2 teaspoon salt"],"instructions":["Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Line a baking sheet with parchment paper.","Beat sweetener and butter together in a bowl until creamy. Add eggs, heavy cream, and almond milk; beat until smooth. Scrape down sides with a spatula.","Mix coconut flakes, coconut flour, almond flour, baking powder, baking soda, and salt together in a separate bowl. Beat into the butter mixture until dough comes together.","Drop teaspoonfuls of cookie dough onto the baking sheets.","Bake in the preheated oven until golden brown, about 17 minutes. Cool on the baking sheet for 3 minutes before transferring to a wire rack."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NEBDzx_Ikl0B_m6ztWO_CX2cB2o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/5895201-keto-coconut-cookies-fabeveryday-4x3-1-e275a11343e6493c90ba51b8a485f548.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/274233/keto-fried-chicken/","title":"Keto Fried Chicken","categories":["Keto"],"description":"This quick and easy fried chicken recipe is perfect for the keto diet. Chicken breast is pounded thin and breaded in a seasoned almond flour coating and fried in avocado oil.","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"10 mins","totalTime":"20 mins","yield":"2 servings","ingredients":["1 (10 ounce) boneless, skinless chicken breast","salt to taste","1 tablespoon blanched almond flour","1/2 cup blanched almond flour","1/4 cup freshly grated Grana Padano cheese","1/2 teaspoon salt, or as needed","1/2 teaspoon freshly ground black pepper","1/2 teaspoon granulated garlic","1/2 teaspoon paprika","1 large egg","2 tablespoons milk","1/4 cup avocado oil for frying, or as needed","1 lemon, quartered"],"instructions":["Remove chicken breast from the fridge 20 minutes before preparing the dish. Cut into 4 equal portions. Place each chicken piece in between plastic wrap and pound with a meat tenderizer to 1/4-inch thickness. Lightly salt chicken on both sides and dust with 1 tablespoon almond flour.","Combine 1/2 cup almond flour, Grana Padano cheese, 1/2 teaspoon salt, pepper, garlic, and paprika in a shallow bowl. Break egg into a second shallow bowl and whisk in milk. Dip each chicken piece first in egg mixture, shaking off excess, then into the almond mixture, pressing down to insure complete coverage. Place breaded chicken pieces on a plate.","Pour enough avocado oil into a large skillet to cover the bottom by a 1/4-inch. Heat over medium-high heat until it shimmers but is not smoking. Carefully lower each piece of chicken into the hot oil and cook for 2 minutes. Turn and cook on the other side until internal temperature reaches 165 degrees F (74 degrees C), about 2 more minutes. Drain chicken on a paper towel-lined plate and serve with lemon wedges."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZCMxaJqYT0JifY3wtKog86jorq8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6708735-keto-fried-chicken-Bren-4x3-1-f8527b6439004b98bd410c55ee2402eb.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/260502/keto-instant-pot-soup-low-carb/","title":"Keto Instant Pot Soup (Low Carb)","categories":["Keto"],"description":"This keto Instant Pot soup recipe with turkey bacon, cauliflower, green bell pepper, and Cheddar cheese is a quick and easy option for any weeknight.","prepTime":"20 mins","cookTime":"35 mins","totalTime":"1 hr","yield":"6 servings","ingredients":["1 tablespoon olive oil","1 large yellow onion, diced","2 cloves garlic, minced","1 head cauliflower, coarsely chopped","1 green bell pepper, chopped","1 tablespoon onion powder","salt and ground black pepper to taste","1 (32 fluid ounce) container chicken stock","2 cups shredded Cheddar cheese","1 cup half-and-half","6 slices cooked turkey bacon, diced","1 tablespoon Dijon mustard","4 dashes hot pepper sauce"],"instructions":["Turn on a multi-functional pressure cooker (such as Instant Pot), add olive oil, and select the Sauté function. Add onion and garlic; cook until browned, about 3 minutes. Add cauliflower, bell pepper, onion powder, salt, and pepper. Pour in chicken stock, then close and lock the lid.","Select the Soup function; set the timer for 15 minutes. Allow 10 to 15 minutes for pressure to build.","Release pressure carefully using the quick-release method according to the manufacturer's instructions, about 5 minutes. Unlock and remove the lid.","Add Cheddar cheese, half-and-half, turkey bacon, Dijon mustard, and hot sauce. Reselect the Sauté function and cook until bubbly, about 5 minutes."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ll75nc3s9G5hanfaiqobXvdgfMA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/4950304-9a68dfe9bff640b48271b957b93ba43b.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/267929/keto-sausage-balls/","title":"Keto Sausage Balls","categories":["Keto"],"description":"These keto sausage balls filled with cream cheese, Parmesan, and Cheddar are the perfect Game Day snack!","prepTime":"15 mins","cookTime":"30 mins","totalTime":"45 mins","yield":"18 sausage balls","ingredients":["1 pound spicy ground pork sausage","1/2 (8 ounce) package cream cheese, at room temperature","1/2 cup shredded sharp Cheddar cheese","1/2 cup grated Parmesan cheese","1 tablespoon Dijon mustard","1/2 teaspoon garlic powder","1/4 teaspoon salt"],"instructions":["Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Line a baking sheet with parchment paper.","Combine sausage, cream cheese, Cheddar cheese, Parmesan cheese, mustard, garlic powder, and salt in a large bowl. Mix gently until just combined. Roll heaping tablespoonfuls of the pork mixture into balls. Place on the prepared baking sheet.","Bake in the preheated oven until golden brown, 30 to 35 minutes. Place on a paper towel-lined plate to soak up excess grease. Serve immediately."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bdIQifbzOjdXnIDTj8b5wE4zrA0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/5755686-keto-sausage-balls-Yoly-4x3-1-074913d5e3004d9eaae500a579b5ef64.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/272437/keto-smothered-chicken-thighs/","title":"Keto Smothered Chicken Thighs","categories":["Keto"],"description":"This keto chicken thigh recipe features juicy bone-in chicken thighs in a creamy mushroom sauce, topped with crispy bacon and green onions.","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"50 mins","totalTime":"1 hr","yield":"4 servings","ingredients":["4 (8 ounce) skin-on, bone-in chicken thighs","1 teaspoon paprika","salt and pepper to taste","4 slices bacon, cut into 1/2 inch pieces","1/3 cup low-sodium chicken broth","4 ounces sliced mushrooms","1/4 cup heavy whipping cream","2 green onions, white and green parts separated and sliced"],"instructions":["Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C).","Season chicken thighs on all sides with paprika, salt, and pepper.","Cook bacon in a cast iron skillet or oven-safe pan over medium-high heat until browned, 4 to 5 minutes. Remove from skillet and drain on a paper towel-lined plate. Drain and discard excess grease from the skillet.","Return the skillet to medium heat and cook chicken thighs, skin-side down, for 3 to 4 minutes. Flip chicken over and place the skillet in the preheated oven.","Bake until chicken thighs are no longer pink at the bone and juices run clear, about 30 minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted near the bone should read 165 degrees F (74 degrees C). Remove chicken to a plate and cover with foil to keep warm. Remove all but 2 tablespoons of drippings from the skillet.","Return the skillet to the stove over medium-high heat. Pour in chicken broth while whisking up brown bits from the bottom of the skillet. Add mushrooms and cook until soft, about 3 to 4 minutes. Pour in heavy whipping cream and whisk together until lightly simmering, then reduce heat to medium-low. Season with salt and pepper, if necessary.","Return chicken and any juices back into the skillet; top with bacon and green onions. Serve immediately, spooning sauce over chicken."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LdVwt281ocw0tKlle0ZJw76c97Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-272437-keto-smothered-chicken-thighs-DDMFS-4x3-f4b602e4fad2451a9eedc9c06b621a8c.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/282931/keto-spinach-squares/","title":"Keto Spinach Squares","categories":["Keto"],"description":"Keto spinach squares, made with frozen spinach, almond flour, almond milk, eggs, and Monterey Jack cheese, is a great recipe for low-carb or keto diets.","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"35 mins","totalTime":"1 hr 30 mins","yield":"10 servings","ingredients":["4 tablespoons salted butter","3 large eggs","1 cup almond flour","1 teaspoon baking powder","1 pinch ground nutmeg","salt to taste","1 cup almond milk","2 (10 ounce) packages frozen chopped spinach, thawed and drained","1 (16 ounce) package shredded Monterey Jack cheese"],"instructions":["Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Melt butter in a 9x13-inch baking pan in oven while preheating.","Beat eggs in a medium bowl. Combine flour, baking powder, nutmeg, and salt in another bowl; add to eggs, alternating with almond milk. Stir in spinach and Monterey Jack cheese; pour into the prepared baking pan.","Bake in the preheated oven until set, 35 to 40 minutes.","Cool before cutting into 10 squares, about 45 minutes."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gpMdsKykVe_tKAqmKdC1a78MpaY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6924013-a923e296b5364473ac70bfa576c1aed5.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/276216/keto-tex-mex-ground-beef-casserole/","title":"Keto Tex-Mex Ground Beef Casserole","categories":["Want to Try"],"description":"Keto and tacos do go together, try this Tex-Mex ground beef casserole recipe with cauliflower rice that has all the flavors of tacos without the carbs.","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"50 mins","totalTime":"1 hr 5 mins","yield":"6 servings (1 (11x7-inch) casserole)","ingredients":["cooking spray","1.5 pounds ground beef","2.5 teaspoons chili powder, divided","2 teaspoons onion powder, divided","2 teaspoons garlic powder, divided","1 teaspoon ground cumin","1 teaspoon ground coriander","salt and ground black pepper to taste","2 eggs","2 tablespoons heavy cream","1 tablespoon extra virgin olive oil","0.5 cup chopped onion","3 tablespoons tomato paste","1 pound frozen riced cauliflower, thawed and drained","1.5 cups grated Cheddar cheese, divided"],"instructions":["Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Coat an 11x7-inch baking dish with cooking spray.","Heat a large nonstick skillet over medium-high heat. Add ground beef; cook and stir until browned and crumbly, 5 to 7 minutes. Stir in 1 ½ teaspoons chili powder, 1 teaspoon onion powder, 1 teaspoon garlic powder, cumin, coriander, salt, and black pepper until evenly distributed. Cook until fragrant, 4 to 5 minutes. Remove from heat.","Whisk eggs and cream together in a bowl; add to beef mixture. Transfer to the prepared baking dish; pat down evenly.","Wipe skillet clean; add olive oil and heat over medium heat. Add onion; cook until soft and translucent, about 2 minutes. Add remaining 1 teaspoon each chili powder, garlic powder, and onion powder; season with salt and black pepper. Stir in tomato paste; cook, stirring often, 2 to 3 minutes. Add cauliflower rice; continue cooking for 4 to 5 minutes. Remove from heat, stir in 1 cup Cheddar cheese; transfer to top beef mixture, smoothing with a spatula to flatten top.","Bake in the preheated oven for 25 to 30 minutes. Sprinkle remaining ½ cup Cheddar over top; continue baking until cheese has melted, about 5 minutes more. Remove from oven; cool about 5 minutes. Serve warm."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Q4TKLTgPggt02FJP71oGdJLHpKg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7301526-d88f1a55046643759e4a5499e45da7a8.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/272323/keto-white-chicken-chili/","title":"Keto White Chicken Chili","categories":["Keto"],"description":"This keto version of white chicken chili is a thick, creamy meal with chunks of sauteed and pulled chicken. Great for those cold winter nights!","prepTime":"20 mins","cookTime":"40 mins","totalTime":"1 hr 10 mins","yield":"8 servings","ingredients":["1 tablespoon oil, or as needed","1 stick butter, divided","2 pounds skinless, boneless chicken breasts","1.5 teaspoons chili powder","salt and ground black pepper to taste","3/4 cup chicken broth","2 cups heavy whipping cream","4 ounces cream cheese","1.5 tablespoons onion powder","2 teaspoons cumin","1 teaspoon hot sauce","1.5 cups grated Monterey Jack cheese","2 (4 ounce) cans chopped green chilies"],"instructions":["Heat a large skillet over medium-high heat and add oil and 2 tablespoons butter.","Meanwhile, season chicken with chili powder, salt, and black pepper. Cook chicken in the skillet on 1 side for 5 minutes, resisting the urge to flip early. Turn and cook, turning occasionally to keep from burning, until no longer pink inside and juices run clear, 10 to 15 minutes, depending on thickness. Transfer chicken to a plate to cool until safe to handle, about 10 minutes. Shred chicken using your fingers and set aside.","Mix remaining 6 tablespoons butter, chicken broth, heavy cream, cream cheese, onion powder, cumin, and hot sauce together in a large, heavy pot. Season with salt and black pepper and bring to a simmer; cook until butter and cream cheese are melted, about 5 minutes.","Add shredded chicken, Monterey Jack cheese, and green chiles to the chili in the pot. Reduce heat to low and cook, stirring occasionally, for 20 minutes."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_XC2-92Z1q8Zbws39AL71fnoLR4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6540933-keto-white-chicken-chili-fabeveryday4x3-03bfbc554e4645d68e0ab216b6718de1.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/257231/layered-salmon-cobb-salad/","title":"Layered Salmon Cobb Salad","categories":["Salads"],"description":"This show-stopping cobb salad with layers of salmon, green beans, and tomatoes will look like a work of art at the center of your table.","prepTime":"45 mins","cookTime":"21 mins","totalTime":"1 hr 6 mins","yield":"6 servings","ingredients":["0.75 cup buttermilk","0.25 cup mayonnaise","2 tablespoons white wine vinegar","0.5 clove garlic, crushed","2 teaspoons chopped fresh dill","salt and ground black pepper to taste","3 cups fresh green beans, trimmed","1 pound salmon fillets","0.5 teaspoon vegetable oil","4 cups chopped green leaf lettuce","1 pound tomatoes, cut into bite-sized pieces","1 (15 ounce) can corn, drained","2 cucumbers, halved and sliced","5 hard-boiled eggs, halved","4 slices cooked bacon, cut into thin strips","4 spring onions, thinly sliced"],"instructions":["Combine buttermilk, mayonnaise, white wine vinegar, and garlic in a jar. Seal and shake well. Stir in dill, salt, and pepper. Refrigerate dressing.","Place a steamer insert into a saucepan and fill with water to just below the bottom of the steamer. Bring water to a boil. Add green beans, cover, and steam until tender, 4 to 5 minutes. Drain and let cool.","Preheat grill for medium heat and lightly oil the grate. Brush salmon with vegetable oil; season with salt and pepper.","Cook salmon on the preheated grill until flesh flakes easily with a fork, 6 to 8 minutes per side.","Layer lettuce, tomatoes, corn, cucumbers, green beans, and hard-boiled eggs in a large glass trifle bowl. Place salmon on top. Garnish with bacon and spring onions. Serve dressing alongside."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pMPWRCi72Lhqut4fs7fi84uLSdk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/4476623-522f0fcff748493c85d425a8db20d4a9.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/236306/roasted-chicken-with-lemon-and-rosemary/","title":"Lemon-Roasted Chicken","categories":["Chicken","Want to Try"],"description":"This lemon-roasted chicken is quick and easy to prep and perfect for a weeknight sheet pan dinner or for serving to company. It's simple yet delicious.","prepTime":"15 mins","cookTime":"45 mins","totalTime":"1 hr","yield":"6 servings (1 roasted chicken)","ingredients":["1 whole chicken, cut into 8 pieces","1 onion, cut into wedges","1 lemon, sliced","8 cloves garlic","4 sprigs fresh rosemary","0.25 cup olive oil","0.5 teaspoon salt","0.5 teaspoon ground black pepper"],"instructions":["Preheat the oven to 450 degrees F (230 degrees C).","Combine chicken, onion, lemon slices, garlic, and rosemary together in a large bowl. Drizzle olive oil and sprinkle salt and black pepper over the chicken mixture; toss to coat. Spread chicken mixture out in the bottom of a baking dish.","Bake in the preheated oven until no longer pink at the bone and the juices run clear, 45 to 50 minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the thickest part of a thigh, near the bone, should read at least 165 degrees F (74 degrees C)."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SseNNotwxJS9s2i3eXVSysvdzKU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/236306-roasted-chicken-with-lemon-and-rosemary-armag-2000-5d2f30a3d3c94f6fb8cc54436d565613.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/270021/low-carb-chicken-vegetable-soup/","title":"Low-Carb Chicken Vegetable Soup","categories":["Soups","Chicken","Want to Try"],"description":"Looking for a keto chicken vegetable soup without noodles or rice? This low-carb recipe makes a great base for all your favorite veggies and spices.","prepTime":"15 mins","cookTime":"35 mins","totalTime":"50 mins","yield":"6 servings","ingredients":["6 cups water","2 cups chicken stock","4 medium celery stalks, sliced","3 medium carrots, sliced","0.5 cup chopped yellow onion","2 tablespoons chopped fresh parsley","2 cloves garlic, minced","1 bay leaf","1 teaspoon ground thyme","0.5 teaspoon paprika","salt and ground black pepper to taste","1 pound chopped cooked chicken","4 cups sliced yellow squash"],"instructions":["Combine water, stock, celery, carrots, onion, parsley, garlic, bay leaf, thyme, paprika, salt, and black pepper in a large pot; bring to a simmer. Cover and cook until vegetables are soft, 20 to 30 minutes.","Add chicken and squash to the pot and simmer until squash is tender, about 10 minutes more."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/99YmAG2riw1x2lAFN8IqYQOCxuY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/9287036-2cba350f2ecd4a07969ca132ce1846ba.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/259310/low-carb-chicken-and-mushroom-soup/","title":"Low-Carb Chicken and Mushroom Soup","categories":["Want to Try"],"description":"A rich addition to any keto diet, this satisfying chicken and mushroom soup is thickened with heavy cream and enhanced with fresh tarragon.","prepTime":"20 mins","cookTime":"40 mins","totalTime":"1 hr","yield":"6 servings","ingredients":["0.5 cup butter","1 cooked chicken breast, cubed","1 small white onion, finely chopped","3 cloves garlic, finely chopped","1.5 pounds fresh mushrooms, sliced","3 cups chicken stock","3 tablespoons chopped fresh tarragon, divided","salt and freshly ground black pepper to taste","2 cups heavy whipping cream"],"instructions":["Melt butter in a Dutch oven over medium-high heat. Add chicken; sauté until lightly browned, about 3 minutes. Add onion and garlic; sauté until softened, about 5 minutes. Stir in mushrooms; sauté until tender, 5 to 10 minutes. Pour in chicken stock and 2 tablespoons tarragon; reduce heat to low. Season with salt. Cover and simmer soup until flavors are combined, about 25 minutes.","Stir cream into soup; cook until heated through but not boiling. Serve soup with pepper and remaining tarragon on top."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/m_q0FUlYx0ZFvMM_MNhO7nrhucQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/4556482-low-carb-chicken-and-mushroom-soup-France-C-4x3-1-1387b68acac644c080efefabd5178b40.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/254788/low-carb-cream-of-broccoli-soup/","title":"Low-Carb Cream of Broccoli Soup","categories":["Keto"],"description":"Tender broccoli, chicken chunks, Cheddar cheese, and heavy cream are simmered together into this low-carb soup suitable for the keto diet.","prepTime":"15 mins","cookTime":"4 hrs 16 mins","totalTime":"4 hrs 31 mins","yield":"16 servings (4 quarts)","ingredients":["2 (14 ounce) cans chicken broth","1 (8 ounce) package cream cheese","1 cup shredded Cheddar cheese","1/4 cup butter","1 tablespoon minced onion flakes","1 pint heavy whipping cream","1 (10 ounce) can chicken chunks, or more to taste","3 heads broccoli, broken into florets"],"instructions":["Combine chicken broth, cream cheese, Cheddar cheese, butter, and onion flakes in a large pot over medium heat; cook and stir until smooth, 3 to 5 minutes. Add heavy cream and chicken; bring to a gentle simmer.","Place a steamer insert into a saucepan and fill with water to just below the bottom of the steamer. Bring water to a boil. Add broccoli, cover, and steam until tender, 4 to 5 minutes. Transfer to a colander to drain excess moisture.","Pour chicken broth mixture into a slow cooker; add broccoli.","Cook on Low until flavors combine, about 4 hours."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/e8obJaFAAEchZX2Iy4NlyZbsHHs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/4414854-31c58668efeb4ef89d169ec835cd5aea.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/259309/low-carb-cream-of-mushroom-soup/","title":"Low-Carb Cream of Mushroom Soup","categories":["Keto"],"description":"This low-carb, high-fat, tangy cream of mushroom soup is the perfect keto meal. Cream cheese thickens this soup, making it both delicious and filling.","prepTime":"20 mins","cookTime":"55 mins","totalTime":"1 hr 15 mins","yield":"6 servings","ingredients":["1/4 cup butter","5 cups coarsely chopped fresh mushrooms","1/2 cup finely chopped onion","1 clove garlic, minced","1/2 teaspoon salt","1/2 teaspoon ground black pepper","1/4 teaspoon dried thyme","1 (32 ounce) carton chicken broth","2 cups heavy whipping cream","1 (4 ounce) package cream cheese","2 tablespoons sherry"],"instructions":["Melt butter in a large, heavy saucepan over medium heat. Add mushrooms, onion, and garlic. Cook, stirring often until tender, about 10 minutes.","Add salt, pepper, and thyme. Stir in chicken broth, heavy cream, and cream cheese.","Reduce heat to a low simmer. Add sherry and continue to cook, stirring constantly, until cream cheese is incorporated, about 45 minutes."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mHK5890L99yc-a1zoCoUyKgJoBw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/4554590-f96bd38fe7034febb18363776831c5dd.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/16723/pesto-chicken-florentine/","title":"Pesto Chicken Florentine","categories":["Pasta"],"description":"Spinach, chicken and pasta are smothered in a glorious creamy pesto sauce.","prepTime":"20 mins","cookTime":"35 mins","totalTime":"55 mins","yield":"4 servings","ingredients":["2 tablespoons olive oil","2 cloves garlic, finely chopped","4 skinless, boneless chicken breast halves - cut into strips","2 cups fresh spinach leaves","1 (4.5 ounce) package dry Alfredo sauce mix","2 tablespoons pesto","1 (8 ounce) package dry penne pasta","1 tablespoon grated Romano cheese"],"instructions":["Heat oil in a large skillet over medium high heat. Add garlic, saute for 1 minute; then add chicken and cook for 7 to 8 minutes on each side. When chicken is close to being cooked through (no longer pink inside), add spinach and saute all together for 3 to 4 minutes.","Meanwhile, prepare Alfredo sauce according to package directions. When finished, stir in 2 tablespoons pesto; set aside.","In a large pot of salted boiling water, cook pasta for 8 to 10 minutes or until al dente. Rinse under cold water and drain.","Add chicken/spinach mixture to pasta, then stir in pesto/Alfredo sauce. Mix well, top with cheese and serve."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/apgN4dJwilJnXiVIOghQpnfg30s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16723pesto-chicken-florentineMyHotSouthernMess4x3-9d5976d8f1254334bec08284d897cb3a.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/23425/pesto-lasagna/","title":"Pesto Lasagna","categories":["Want to Try"],"description":"A lovely lasagna that's a snap to make with prepared basil pesto and Alfredo sauce, spinach, ricotta, mozzarella, and Parmesan cheese.","prepTime":"35 mins","cookTime":"45 mins","totalTime":"1 hr 30 mins","yield":"8 servings","ingredients":["1 (16 ounce) package lasagna noodles","2 tablespoons olive oil","1 small onion, chopped","1 (16 ounce) package frozen chopped spinach, thawed","7 ounces basil pesto","30 ounces ricotta cheese","1 egg","0.5 teaspoon salt","0.25 teaspoon ground black pepper","0.25 teaspoon ground nutmeg","2 cups mozzarella cheese, shredded","9 ounces Alfredo-style pasta sauce","0.25 cup grated Parmesan cheese"],"instructions":["Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).","Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Add lasagna and cook for 8 to 10 minutes or until al dente; drain.","In large skillet over medium heat, sauté onion in olive oil until tender. Stir in spinach; remove from heat and stir in pesto.","In a large bowl mix ricotta cheese, egg, salt, pepper, and nutmeg.","In a 3-quart greased baking dish, layer noodles then spinach mixture, followed by ricotta mixture. Sprinkle with mozzarella cheese. Repeat the layers ending with noodles on top. Spread Alfredo sauce on top of noodles and sprinkle with Parmesan cheese.","Cover with foil and bake in the preheated oven for 45 to 55 minutes."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iC0fhJvGag_hmsCM3k5OvMisamg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/Pesto-Lasagna-luvz2cook-4x3-1-2000-1053bcb7f69441a1bf93b01e74f02b67.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/46982/pesto-pasta-with-chicken/","title":"Pesto Pasta with Chicken","categories":["Pasta"],"description":"Easy chicken pesto pasta recipe made with sautéed garlic chicken tossed with bow tie pasta, sun-dried tomatoes, and pesto sauce, ready in 30 minutes.","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"20 mins","totalTime":"30 mins","yield":"8 servings","ingredients":["1 (16 ounce) package bow tie pasta","1 teaspoon olive oil","2 cloves garlic, minced","2 skinless, boneless chicken breasts, cut into bite-sized pieces","1 pinch crushed red pepper flakes, or to taste","0.5 cup pesto sauce","0.33333334326744 cup oil-packed sun-dried tomatoes, drained and cut into strips"],"instructions":["Gather all ingredients.","Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Add pasta and cook until al dente, 8 to 10 minutes; drain.","Heat oil in a large skillet over medium heat. Sauté garlic until tender.","Stir in chicken and season with red pepper flakes. Cook until chicken is golden and cooked through.","Combine pasta, chicken, pesto, and sun-dried tomatoes in a large bowl; toss to coat evenly."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ALYcbI-A_YYn5jiboWYPE2rt310=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-46982-pesto-pasta-with-chicken-DDMFS-4x3-5e043df9d5174cf4ac53612ee0f5b56e.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/220751/quick-chicken-piccata/","title":"Quick Chicken Piccata","categories":["Chicken"],"description":"This easy chicken piccata recipe from Chef John pan-fries chicken in a delicious Italian piccata sauce made with lemon, capers, white wine, and parsley.","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"15 mins","totalTime":"25 mins","yield":"4 servings","ingredients":["4 skinless, boneless chicken breast halves","cayenne pepper to taste","salt and ground black pepper to taste","all-purpose flour for dredging","2 tablespoons olive oil","1 tablespoon capers, drained","1/2 cup white wine","1/4 cup fresh lemon juice","1/4 cup water","3 tablespoons cold unsalted butter, cut in 1/4-inch slices","2 tablespoons chopped fresh Italian parsley"],"instructions":["Place chicken breasts between 2 sheets of heavy plastic on a solid, level surface. Firmly pound chicken breasts with the smooth side of a meat mallet to a 1/2-inch thickness.","Season both sides of chicken breasts with cayenne, salt, and black pepper; dredge lightly in flour and shake off any excess.","Heat olive oil in a skillet over medium-high heat. Place chicken in the pan, reduce heat to medium, and cook until browned and cooked through, about 5 minutes per side; transfer to a plate.","Cook capers in reserved oil, smashing them lightly to release brine, until warmed through, about 30 seconds. Pour white wine into the skillet and bring to a boil while scraping the browned bits of food off the bottom of the pan with a wooden spoon. Cook until reduced by half, about 2 minutes.","Stir lemon juice, water, and butter into the reduced wine mixture; cook and stir continuously to form a thick sauce, about 2 minutes. Reduce heat to low and stir parsley through the sauce.","Return chicken breasts to the pan and turn to coat in sauce. Cook until heated through, 1 to 2 minutes."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dhOTNXUrXiXTPOhjA9OT-JkpUaM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/220751quick-chicken-piccataFranceCvideo2x3-8724612f4d2c43d99b9d252548fd308e.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/263328/roasted-leeks-with-eggs-paleo-and-keto-friendly/","title":"Roasted Leeks with Eggs (Paleo and Keto-Friendly)","categories":["Keto","Want to Try"],"description":"Vegetarians will enjoy this paleo, keto-friendly sheet-pan meal of roasted leeks and green onions topped with avocado vinaigrette, almonds, and sunny-side-up eggs.","prepTime":"25 mins","cookTime":"15 mins","totalTime":"40 mins","yield":"2 servings","ingredients":["2 leeks","3 green onions","2 tablespoons ghee (clarified butter), melted","1/2 teaspoon sea salt","1/4 teaspoon ground black pepper","1 ripe avocado, pitted, flesh scooped from skin","3/4 cup light olive oil","1 lemon, juiced","1/4 cup red wine vinegar","salt and ground black pepper to taste","1 teaspoon olive oil","2 eggs","1/4 cup sliced almonds, toasted","1/8 teaspoon red pepper flakes"],"instructions":["Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C).","Discard green tops and the bottom 1/2 inch of the leeks. Cut leeks in half lengthwise.","Place leeks and green onions on a sheet pan. Drizzle with ghee. Add sea salt and pepper.","Roast in the preheated oven until browned, 15 to 20 minutes.","Prepare vinaigrette by blending avocado, 3/4 cup olive oil, lemon juice, vinegar, salt, and pepper thoroughly in a food processor.","Heat 1 teaspoon oil in a skillet over medium-low heat. Crack eggs into opposite sides of the skillet and cook until whites are barely set and yolks are still runny, 2 to 3 minutes.","Remove leeks and onions from oven and top with the sunny-side up eggs. Sprinkle almonds and red pepper flakes on top. Finish with a drizzle of the avocado vinaigrette."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CUBrHDNTNgnp7qzcejfBFFK2N7w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/4536970-ad6dba384abb428994892a15749121e8.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/238666/sandies-seven-layer-bean-dip/","title":"Sandie's Seven-Layer Bean Dip","categories":["Beef"],"description":"Refried beans, ground beef, sour cream, tomatoes, and Mexican cheese-blend are baked into a crowd-pleasing 7-layer dip; serve with tortilla chips.","prepTime":"15 mins","cookTime":"35 mins","totalTime":"50 mins","yield":"24 servings","ingredients":["1 (16 ounce) container sour cream","1 (8 ounce) package cream cheese, softened","1 (1 ounce) package taco seasoning mix","1 pound ground beef","1 teaspoon ground cumin","1 teaspoon dried oregano","1 teaspoon garlic powder","1 teaspoon salt","ground black pepper to taste","1 (30 ounce) can refried beans","1 (16 ounce) jar salsa","1 (16 ounce) jar salsa con queso","2 cups shredded Mexican cheese blend","1 plum tomato, chopped","1 (6 ounce) can sliced black olives, drained","3 green onions, chopped"],"instructions":["Preheat oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).","Mix sour cream, cream cheese, and taco seasoning mix together in a bowl.","Heat a large skillet over medium-high heat. Cook and stir beef with the cumin, oregano, garlic powder, salt, and black pepper in the hot skillet until browned and crumbly, 5 to 7 minutes; drain and discard grease.","Spread refried beans into the bottom of a 9x13-inch baking dish. Layer ground beef mixture over refried beans, lightly pressing beef into beans; top with sour cream mixture.","Stir salsa and salsa con queso together in a bowl; pour over sour cream mixture layer. Spread Mexican cheese blend, tomato, olives, and green onions, respectively, over sour cream mixture layer.","Bake in the preheated oven until heated through and bubbling, about 30 minutes."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cgUwK0k1LoPbLwd64D4xjuKb8YM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/1374474-acfc9c98262e499eadaca239ba773eb3.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/24532/sausage-casserole/","title":"Sausage Casserole","categories":["Breakfast"],"description":"This sausage casserole recipe combines shredded potatoes, onions, cottage cheese, and sausage baked with eggs and Cheddar for a family-pleasing breakfast.","prepTime":"25 mins","cookTime":"1 hr 5 mins","totalTime":"1 hr 35 mins","yield":"12 servings (1 9x13-inch casserole)","ingredients":["1 pound sage flavored breakfast sausage","3 cups shredded potatoes, drained and pressed","0.25 cup butter, melted","1 (16 ounce) container small curd cottage cheese","12 ounces mild Cheddar cheese, shredded","0.5 cup onion, shredded","6 jumbo eggs"],"instructions":["Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Lightly grease a 9x13-inch baking dish.","Heat a large, deep skillet over medium-high heat. Cook sausage in the hot skillet until evenly browned and crumbly, 5 to 7 minutes. Drain and discard grease.","Stir together shredded potatoes and butter in the prepared baking dish; lightly press mixture into the bottom and sides of the dish.","Mix together sausage, cottage cheese, Cheddar cheese, onion, and eggs in a bowl. Pour over potato mixture.","Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the center of casserole comes out clean, about 1 hour. Let cool for 5 minutes before serving.","Enjoy!"],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0YMAQ10wfhray15xrafAqyYHzI0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24532-sausage-casserole-hero-4x3-55f06ee368d34d36bb69c0a51255ec3f.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/268046/simple-keto-zucchini-hash/","title":"Simple Keto Zucchini Hash","categories":["Keto","Want to Try"],"description":"Scramble grated zucchini and Parmesan cheese with eggs for a tasty, effortless keto hash, perfect as a side dish.","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"20 mins","totalTime":"30 mins","yield":"4 servings","ingredients":["4 small zucchini, grated and squeezed dry","3 tablespoons coconut oil","1 tablespoon butter","1/3 cup grated Parmesan cheese","1 teaspoon chili powder, or more to taste","1 teaspoon sea salt","1 teaspoon cayenne pepper","2 eggs, beaten"],"instructions":["Combine zucchini with coconut oil and butter in a medium skillet over medium heat. Add Parmesan cheese, chili powder, salt, and cayenne pepper. Stir until cheese melts.","Reduce heat to low and add eggs; stir quickly until fully mixed in. Increase heat back to medium and cook, stirring and flipping occasionally, until edges of the hash are lightly browned, about 15 minutes."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nBSZ1JgVwPcxF_56BfGPEI2wFG8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/5770338-e7659d6ecaad4e509b20eae3a56f8c0f.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/279863/smoked-mozzarella-skillet-chicken/","title":"Smoked Mozzarella Skillet Chicken","categories":["Want to Try"],"description":"This smoked mozzarella skillet chicken recipe takes pounded breasts, cooks them quickly in a cast-iron skillet, then melts smoked mozzarella over top.","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"10 mins","totalTime":"25 mins","yield":"4 servings","ingredients":["4 skinless, boneless chicken breast halves","2 teaspoons dried oregano","1 teaspoon onion powder","1 teaspoon salt","1 tablespoon olive oil","1 (8 ounce) package smoked mozzarella cheese, thinly sliced"],"instructions":["Place chicken breasts on a work surface; cover with waxed paper. Pound each breast with the smooth side of a meat mallet to an even thickness; sprinkle both sides with oregano, onion powder, and salt.","Heat olive oil in a large cast-iron skillet over medium heat. Add breasts; cook for about 4 minutes. Flip; cook about 3 minutes more. Top breasts with sliced mozzarella. Cover the skillet; cook until cheese has melted and chicken is no longer pink in the center and the juices run clear, 2 to 3 minutes more. An instant-read thermometer inserted into centers should read at least 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).","Transfer breasts to plates; cool before serving, 1 minute."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/d15-IWkpSu6wf9oBTYDc7WHKaqs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8028733-c6d3bc86ada14e559c011b614c778500.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/217912/spences-pesto-chicken-pasta/","title":"Spence's Pesto Chicken Pasta","categories":["Pasta"],"description":"A lovely and colorful pasta dish combines chicken with garlic, mushrooms, red peppers, artichoke hearts, spinach, and basil pesto. It's easy and quick, but looks and tastes elegant and special.","prepTime":"20 mins","cookTime":"25 mins","totalTime":"45 mins","yield":"4 servings","ingredients":["0.5 pound linguine pasta","1 (8 ounce) skinless, boneless chicken breast, cut into small pieces","salt and ground black pepper to taste","3 tablespoons olive oil","6 whole garlic cloves","4 ounces fresh mushrooms, halved","6 ounces roasted red peppers, drained and chopped","1 (7.5 ounce) jar marinated artichoke hearts, drained and quartered","3 ounces fresh spinach leaves","0.25 cup prepared basil pesto, or to taste","1 tablespoon freshly grated Parmesan cheese, divided"],"instructions":["Fill a large pot with lightly salted water and bring to a rolling boil over high heat. Once the water is boiling, stir in the linguine, and return to a boil. Cook the pasta uncovered, stirring occasionally, until the pasta has cooked through, but is still firm to the bite, about 11 minutes. Drain well in a colander set in the sink.","While the pasta is boiling, sprinkle the chicken with salt and black pepper. Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat, and cook the chicken pieces until lightly browned, about 10 minutes, stirring frequently. Stir in the garlic cloves, mushrooms, roasted red peppers, and artichoke hearts; reduce heat to a simmer, and cook until the mushrooms begin to give off their juices, 5 to 8 minutes. Stir in the spinach, and simmer just until the leaves are wilted, about 2 minutes.","Transfer the cooked linguine into a bowl, and toss with the basil pesto. Divide the pasta between 2 plates, and serve topped with the chicken mixture. Sprinkle Parmesan cheese over each plate to serve."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tLQAp8LwVmX7E851IOczk9t_h0M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/642143-6205b61ae2764fc0b433668aff4c00e0.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/200283/spinach-basil-pesto/","title":"Spinach Basil Pesto","categories":["Sauces"],"description":"This tasty spinach pesto is easy to make by blending fresh spinach and basil with lemon juice, lemon zest, garlic, olive oil, and Parmesan cheese.","prepTime":"20 mins","cookTime":null,"totalTime":"20 mins","yield":"24 servings","ingredients":["1.5 cups baby spinach leaves","0.75 cup fresh basil leaves","0.5 cup toasted pine nuts","0.5 cup grated Parmesan cheese","0.5 cup extra-virgin olive oil, divided","4 cloves garlic, peeled and quartered","1 tablespoon fresh lemon juice","0.75 teaspoon kosher salt","0.5 teaspoon lemon zest","0.5 teaspoon freshly ground black pepper"],"instructions":["Place spinach, basil, pine nuts, Parmesan cheese, 2 tablespoons olive oil, garlic, lemon juice, salt, lemon zest, and pepper into a food processor; blend until nearly smooth, scraping the sides of the bowl with a spatula as necessary.","Drizzle remaining olive oil into the mixture while processing until smooth.","Enjoy!"],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_4wwT0rq8ebbgtonV6nDj-0rECc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/200283-spinach-basil-pesto-DDMFS-4x3-c09e7fef9eca4f65aaba45b996bdf75c.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/30522/unbelievable-chicken/","title":"Unbelievable Chicken","categories":["Want to Try"],"description":"Your taste buds will love this exciting blend of brown sugar, cider vinegar, garlic, mustard, lemon, and lime in this easy marinade for juicy chicken.","prepTime":"15 mins","cookTime":"20 mins","totalTime":"9 hrs","yield":"6 servings","ingredients":["0.25 cup cider vinegar","3 tablespoons prepared coarse-ground mustard","3 cloves garlic, peeled and minced","1 lime, juiced","0.5 lemon, juiced","0.5 cup brown sugar","1.5 teaspoons salt","ground black pepper to taste","6 tablespoons olive oil","6 skinless, boneless chicken breast halves"],"instructions":["Mix cider vinegar, mustard, garlic, lime juice, lemon juice, brown sugar, salt, and pepper together in a large glass or ceramic bowl. Whisk in olive oil. Add chicken and toss evenly to coat. Cover, and marinate in the refrigerator for 8 hours to overnight.","Preheat an outdoor grill for high heat.","Lightly oil the grill grate. Place chicken on the preheated grill, and cook 6 to 8 minutes per side, until juices run clear. Discard any remaining marinade."],"image":"https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nViWg3vWrR5QSDLbo_RBlObo5So=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/30522-unbelievable-chicken-PICS-Beauty-4x3-b740b7a279e440418f90b248a7d08892.jpg"},{"url":"https://www.indianhealthyrecipes.com/chicken-tikka-masala/","title":"Chicken Tikka Masala","categories":["Chicken"],"description":"Tender grilled chicken tikka simmered in a rich, aromatic onion-tomato masala with cream, warm spices, and kasuri methi.","prepTime":"20 mins","cookTime":"40 mins","totalTime":"1 hr + 8 hrs resting","yield":"6 servings","ingredients":["1½ lbs (700 g) boneless chicken thighs or breasts","½ cup (120 ml) Greek yogurt or hung curd","½ to 1 tsp Kashmiri red chili powder, plus ½ to 1 tsp for the sauce","3 tsp garam masala, divided","¼ tsp turmeric","2 tbsp coriander powder, divided","1½ to 2 tsp cumin powder, divided","1½ tsp salt, divided, plus more to taste","1 tbsp lemon juice","2 tbsp kasuri methi (dried fenugreek leaves), divided","2 tbsp ginger-garlic paste, divided","1 tbsp oil for the marinade","3 tbsp oil or ghee for the sauce","1½ cups (180 g) finely chopped onions","1 green chili, optional","1 to 2 tsp sugar, to taste","1 lb (450 g) tomatoes, chopped or pureed, or 1¼ cups (10 oz) passata/tomato puree","1 cup hot water","½ cup heavy/whipping cream, or cashew cream","3 tbsp heavy cream for garnish","3 tbsp finely chopped coriander/cilantro leaves for garnish"],"instructions":["Cut the chicken into 1- to 1½-inch pieces and pat dry. Mix with yogurt, chili powder, 1 teaspoon garam masala, turmeric, 1 tablespoon coriander powder, ½ teaspoon cumin, ½ teaspoon salt, lemon juice, 1 tablespoon kasuri methi, 1 tablespoon ginger-garlic paste, and 1 tablespoon oil.","Cover and refrigerate for at least 8 hours and up to 48 hours; 3 hours works in a pinch.","For the sauce, heat 3 tablespoons oil or ghee. Add onions and 1 teaspoon salt; cook over medium heat until deep golden, about 10 to 12 minutes.","Add green chili and the remaining ginger-garlic paste. Cook 40 to 60 seconds, until fragrant.","Lower the heat and quickly stir in the remaining chili powder, 2 teaspoons garam masala, 1 tablespoon coriander powder, and 1 to 1½ teaspoons cumin powder.","Add tomatoes and cook until the mixture is very thick. Pour in 1 cup hot water, bring to a boil, cover, and simmer 12 to 14 minutes. For a smoother sauce, cool slightly, blend, and return to the pot.","Meanwhile, cook the chicken until lightly charred: oven at 460°F (240°C) for 9 to 10 minutes per side, air fryer at 400°F (200°C) for about 6 minutes per side, or in a hot skillet for about 3 minutes per side in batches.","Stir sugar and ½ cup cream (or cashew cream) into the sauce and simmer until thick and aromatic.","Add the cooked chicken and the remaining kasuri methi. Simmer 2 to 3 minutes, until the chicken is tender and the sauce reaches serving consistency. Add hot water only if needed.","Taste and adjust salt, garam masala, and sugar. Garnish with cream and chopped coriander/cilantro. Serve with naan, roti, paratha, basmati rice, or jeera rice."],"image":"https://www.indianhealthyrecipes.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/chicken-tikka-masala.jpg"},{"url":"https://theproteinchef.co/slow-cooker-taco-soup-recipe/","title":"Slow Cooker Taco Soup","categories":["Soups","Want to Try"],"description":"A hearty slow-cooker soup with lean meat, beans, corn and taco seasoning. Adapted from The Protein Chef.","prepTime":"15 mins","cookTime":"3–4 hrs high / 7–8 hrs low","totalTime":"4 hrs 15 mins on high","yield":"6 bowls","ingredients":["2 lb lean ground beef, turkey or chicken","1 tbsp oil","½ onion, chopped (optional)","4 tsp minced garlic (optional)","28 oz canned diced tomatoes","8 oz bone broth","8 oz salsa","4 oz canned diced green chiles","15½ oz canned kidney beans, drained and rinsed","15 oz canned black beans, drained and rinsed","15¼ oz canned corn","1 oz taco seasoning","1½ tbsp ranch seasoning"],"instructions":["Heat the oil in a skillet over medium heat. Brown the meat with the optional onion and garlic, breaking it up as it cooks, about 5–10 minutes.","Transfer to a slow cooker. Stir in the remaining ingredients; add extra broth if needed.","Cover and cook for 3–4 hours on high or 7–8 hours on low. Divide into six bowls."],"image":"https://media.theproteinchef.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Slow-Cooker-Taco-Soup-Recipe-500x500.jpg"},{"url":"https://theproteinchef.co/easy-sheet-pan-chicken-fajitas-recipe/","title":"Easy Sheet Pan Chicken Fajitas","categories":["Chicken","Want to Try"],"description":"Chicken, peppers and onion roasted with lime and spices. Adapted from The Protein Chef.","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"40 mins","totalTime":"50 mins","yield":"5 bowls","ingredients":["2 lb chicken breast or thighs, sliced into strips","4 large bell peppers: green, yellow, red and orange, chopped","1 large red onion, chopped","1 tbsp chili powder","1 1/2 tsp smoked paprika","3/4 tsp garlic powder","3/4 tsp onion powder","1 tsp oregano","3/4 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp black pepper","1/4 tsp salt (optional)","1 oz low-sodium soy sauce","1 oz lime juice","2 tbsp olive oil"],"instructions":["Combine chicken, vegetables, seasonings, soy sauce, lime juice and oil in a bowl or sealable bag. Mix well; marinating is optional.","Spread evenly on a lightly oiled sheet pan. Bake at 400 F (204 C) for about 40 minutes, turning everything after 20-25 minutes."],"image":"https://media.theproteinchef.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Easy-Sheet-Pan-Chicken-Fajitas-Recipe-500x500.jpg"},{"url":"https://theproteinchef.co/taco-pasta-recipe/","title":"Taco Pasta","categories":["Pasta","Want to Try"],"description":"A cheesy pasta skillet with seasoned ground meat and salsa. Adapted from The Protein Chef.","prepTime":"5 mins","cookTime":"10 mins","totalTime":"20 mins (source estimate)","yield":"5 bowls","ingredients":["1 tbsp oil","1-2 bell peppers, chopped (optional)","1/2 onion, chopped (optional)","1 lb lean ground beef, chicken or turkey","3/4 cup water","1 oz reduced-sodium taco seasoning","8 oz pasta, cooked according to package directions","1 1/2 cups salsa","3/4 cup shredded taco cheese"],"instructions":["Heat oil over medium-high heat. Soften the optional chopped peppers and onion for a few minutes, stirring.","Reduce to medium. Add ground meat and break it apart as it cooks until browned.","Lower the heat and stir in water and taco seasoning. Simmer briefly while cooking the pasta separately.","Fold in drained pasta, salsa and cheese. Stir over low heat until the cheese melts, then serve."],"image":"https://media.theproteinchef.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Taco-Pasta-Recipe-500x500.jpg"},{"url":"https://theproteinchef.co/healthy-baked-ziti-with-cottage-cheese-recipe/","title":"Healthy Baked Ziti with Cottage Cheese","categories":["Pasta","Want to Try"],"description":"A cottage-cheese pasta bake from The Protein Chef.","prepTime":"15 mins","cookTime":"1 hr","totalTime":"1 hr 15 mins","yield":"6 servings","ingredients":["8 oz dry pasta","2 1/2 cups pasta sauce, divided","1 1/2 cups cottage cheese","10 oz lean ground beef, turkey, chicken or vegetarian alternative (weigh before cooking; cook before mixing)","1 1/2 cups mozzarella, divided","1 large egg","1 tbsp Italian seasoning","2 tsp minced garlic","Black pepper to taste","3 tbsp Parmesan"],"instructions":["Boil pasta for 1-2 minutes less than the package directs; drain.","Combine 1 1/2 cups sauce, cottage cheese, cooked protein, 1 cup mozzarella, egg, seasonings and garlic. Fold in pasta.","Grease a 2-quart baking dish. Layer 1/2 cup sauce, pasta mixture, remaining sauce, remaining mozzarella and Parmesan.","Cover with foil and bake at 375 F (190 C) for 45-50 minutes. Uncover and bake about 10 minutes more to brown the cheese."],"image":"https://media.theproteinchef.co/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Healthy-Baked-Ziti-with-Cottage-Cheese-Recipe-500x500.jpg"},{"url":"https://theproteinchef.co/easy-white-chicken-chili-recipe/","title":"Easy White Chicken Chili","categories":["Chicken","Soups","Want to Try"],"description":"Creamy slow-cooker chicken and white beans from The Protein Chef.","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"5-6 hrs low / 3-4 hrs high","totalTime":"6 hrs 10 mins on low","yield":"12 bowls","ingredients":["1 yellow onion, chopped","2-3 garlic cloves, minced","1 tbsp olive oil","3 lb chicken breast, trimmed","32 oz bone broth (less for thicker chili)","4 oz diced green chiles","4 oz diced jalapenos","2 cups corn, canned or frozen","2 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp oregano","1/2 tsp chili powder","1/4 tsp cayenne","1/2 tsp salt","Black pepper to taste","Two 15.5 oz cans white beans, drained and rinsed","5.3 oz (150 g) plain Greek yogurt","4 oz cream cheese"],"instructions":["Soften onion and garlic in olive oil. Mash half of one can of beans.","Place chicken, onion mixture, beans, broth, vegetables and seasonings in the slow cooker; stir and cover. Reserve both dairy ingredients.","Cook on low for 5-6 hours or high for 3-4 hours. Shred the chicken.","Stir in yogurt and cream cheese; continue on low until smooth and creamy."],"image":"https://media.theproteinchef.co/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Easy-White-Chicken-Chili-Recipe-500x500.jpg"},{"url":"https://theproteinchef.co/slow-cooker-burrito-bowls-recipe/","title":"Slow Cooker Burrito Bowls","categories":["Chicken","Want to Try"],"description":"Slow-cooked chicken, black beans and corn from The Protein Chef.","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"4-5 hrs high / 7-8 hrs low","totalTime":"4 hrs 10 mins to 5 hrs 10 mins on high","yield":"5 bowls","ingredients":["2 lb chicken breast, trimmed and halved","Two 15.5 oz (439 g) cans low-sodium black beans, drained and rinsed","24 oz salsa","2 cups frozen corn","1/2 cup water","1 1/2 tsp minced garlic","1 tbsp chili powder","2 tsp ground cumin","1 tsp cayenne","1 tsp oregano","Black pepper to taste","Optional for serving: cooked rice, cheese, sour cream or plain Greek yogurt, green onions"],"instructions":["Arrange chicken in the slow cooker. Add beans, salsa, corn, water, garlic and spices.","Stir gently, keeping chicken beneath the mixture, then cover. Cook on high for 4-5 hours or low for 7-8 hours.","Shred the cooked chicken with two forks and mix back in. Divide into five portions; serve with optional rice and toppings."],"image":"https://theproteinchef.co/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/Slow-Cooker-Burrito-Bowls-Recipe-500x500.jpg"},{"url":"https://theproteinchef.co/leftover-turkey-or-chicken-casserole-recipe/","title":"Leftover Turkey or Chicken Casserole","categories":["Chicken","Thanksgiving","Want to Try"],"description":"A broccoli and stuffing casserole for cooked poultry leftovers, adapted from The Protein Chef.","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"30-35 mins","totalTime":"40-45 mins","yield":"5 servings","ingredients":["9 oz cooked turkey or chicken","2 cups broccoli, fresh or thawed","1/2 can cream of chicken soup (98% fat-free)","5.3 oz plain Greek yogurt","1 cup shredded reduced-fat Swiss cheese","2 1/2 servings dry stuffing mix (measure using package serving size)","1/2 cup hot water","1-2 tbsp bacon bits (optional)"],"instructions":["Heat oven to 350 F (176 C). Spread cooked turkey or chicken in a small baking dish, then add broccoli.","Combine soup, yogurt and Swiss cheese; spread over the broccoli.","Moisten stuffing mix with hot water and distribute over the casserole. Add optional bacon bits.","Bake for 30-35 minutes."],"image":"https://media.theproteinchef.co/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/Leftover-Turkey-or-Chicken-Casserole-Recipe-500x500.jpg"},{"url":"https://theproteinchef.co/bodybuilding-chicken-parmesan-recipe/","title":"Bodybuilding Chicken Parmesan","categories":["Chicken","Want to Try"],"description":"Breaded oven-baked chicken with tomato sauce and mozzarella, adapted from The Protein Chef.","prepTime":"5 mins","cookTime":"25-30 mins","totalTime":"30-35 mins","yield":"6 pieces","ingredients":["1 1/2 lb chicken breast","2 extra-large egg whites","1 tbsp olive oil","2/3 cup whole-wheat breadcrumbs","1/2 cup grated Parmesan","1/2 cup pasta sauce","3/4 cup reduced-fat mozzarella","Nonstick cooking spray for pan and topping"],"instructions":["Heat oven to 450 F (232 C). Trim chicken and slice horizontally into thin cutlets.","Whisk egg whites with oil in one bowl. Combine breadcrumbs and Parmesan in another.","Coat both sides of each cutlet in the egg mixture, then bread with the crumb mixture. Arrange on a greased baking sheet and lightly spray the tops.","Bake for 20 minutes. Turn cutlets over and divide sauce and mozzarella among them. Bake another 5-10 minutes, until cooked through and cheese melts."],"image":"https://media.theproteinchef.co/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/Bodybuilding-Chicken-Parmesan-Recipe-500x500.jpg"},{"url":"https://theproteinchef.co/slow-cooker-chicken-fajitas-recipe/","title":"Slow Cooker Chicken Fajitas","categories":["Chicken","Want to Try"],"description":"Chicken with peppers, beans and salsa, adapted from The Protein Chef.","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"3-4 hrs high / 6-8 hrs low","totalTime":"3 hrs 10 mins to 4 hrs 10 mins on high","yield":"5 bowls","ingredients":["One 15 oz can reduced-sodium black beans, drained and rinsed","2 tsp lime juice","16 oz salsa","14.5 oz no-salt-added diced tomatoes","2 1/2 tsp minced garlic (or 5 cloves)","1.12 oz packet low-sodium fajita seasoning","1/2 cup chopped red onion","1/2 cup chopped green pepper","1/2 cup chopped yellow pepper","1/4 tsp cayenne pepper","3 lb chicken breast, trimmed and halved","Optional for serving: tortillas, cheese, sour cream or plain Greek yogurt"],"instructions":["Place chicken, beans, vegetables, salsa, tomatoes, lime juice, garlic and seasonings in the slow cooker. Stir to combine and cover.","Cook on high for 3-4 hours or low for 6-8 hours, until chicken is cooked through. Shred if desired.","Divide among five bowls, or use as tortilla filling with optional toppings."],"image":"https://media.theproteinchef.co/wp-content/uploads/2015/04/Slow-Cooker-Chicken-Fajitas-Recipe-500x500.jpg"},{"url":"https://theproteinchef.co/easy-baked-garlic-chicken-recipe/","title":"Easy Baked Garlic Chicken","categories":["Chicken","Want to Try"],"description":"Garlic-coated chicken with a Parmesan breadcrumb crust, adapted from The Protein Chef.","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"30-35 mins","totalTime":"40-45 mins","yield":"10 pieces","ingredients":["3 lb chicken breast","4 tbsp olive oil","2 1/2 tsp minced garlic (about 5 cloves)","1/4 tsp garlic salt","2/3 cup whole-wheat breadcrumbs","3/4 cup grated Parmesan"],"instructions":["Heat oven to 425 F (218 C). Warm olive oil, garlic and garlic salt in a skillet over medium-low heat for a few minutes, stirring; remove from heat.","Combine breadcrumbs and Parmesan in a bowl. Trim chicken breasts and cut them in half.","Coat chicken in the garlic oil, then the breadcrumb mixture. Arrange in a baking dish.","Bake for 30-35 minutes, until each piece reaches an internal temperature of 165 F (74 C)."],"image":"https://media.theproteinchef.co/wp-content/uploads/2013/08/Easy-Baked-Garlic-Chicken-Recipe-500x500.jpg"},{"url":"https://theproteinchef.co/healthy-mexican-casserole-recipe/","title":"Healthy Mexican Casserole","categories":["Beef","Chicken","Want to Try"],"description":"A layered tortilla casserole with seasoned ground meat, beans, peppers and cheese, adapted from The Protein Chef.","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"30-35 mins","totalTime":"40-45 mins","yield":"8 pieces","ingredients":["1 tbsp oil","1 1/2 lb lean ground turkey, beef or chicken","1 green bell pepper, chopped","1 yellow bell pepper, chopped","1 red bell pepper, chopped","1/2 red onion, chopped","2 tsp minced garlic","1 1/2 tbsp chili powder","2 tsp ground cumin","10 oz low-sodium diced tomatoes with green chiles","15.5 oz low-sodium black beans, drained and rinsed","1 cup corn","10 oz low-sodium enchilada sauce, divided","6 mini tortillas","8 oz low-sodium refried beans","1 cup Mexican-blend cheese"],"instructions":["Heat oven to 350 F (176 C). Warm oil in a large skillet over medium heat. Brown the ground meat with peppers, onion and garlic for 5-8 minutes.","Reduce heat to low. Stir in chili powder, cumin, tomatoes, black beans, corn and half the enchilada sauce; remove from heat.","Spread the remaining enchilada sauce in a 9-by-13-inch baking dish. Spread refried beans on the tortillas and arrange them over the sauce, overlapping as needed.","Add the meat mixture and top with cheese. Bake for 30-35 minutes, until the cheese melts and the edges bubble."],"image":"https://media.theproteinchef.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Healthy-Mexican-Casserole-Recipe-500x500.jpg"},{"url":"https://theproteinchef.co/slow-cooker-mexican-shredded-chicken-recipe/","title":"Slow Cooker Mexican Shredded Chicken","categories":["Chicken","Want to Try"],"description":"Tender taco-seasoned shredded chicken with tomatoes, green chiles and lime, adapted from The Protein Chef.","prepTime":"5 mins","cookTime":"2-3 hrs high / 4-5 hrs low, plus 15-20 mins","totalTime":"About 5 hrs 5 mins on low","yield":"6 bowls","ingredients":["3 lb boneless chicken thighs or chicken breast, trimmed","1/2 white onion, chopped (optional)","1 oz reduced-sodium taco seasoning","20 oz diced tomatoes with green chiles","4 oz green chiles (only if using plain diced tomatoes)","1 lime, juiced","Fresh cilantro for serving (optional)"],"instructions":["Put the optional onion in the slow cooker and arrange chicken in a single layer on top.","Add taco seasoning and tomatoes with green chiles. Cover and cook on high for 2-3 hours or low for 4-5 hours, until chicken reaches at least 165 F (74 C).","Shred the chicken with two forks. Stir in lime juice, cover, and cook on low for another 15-20 minutes.","Divide among six bowls and add optional cilantro, or use the chicken for tacos, omelets or stuffed peppers."],"image":"https://media.theproteinchef.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Slow-Cooker-Mexican-Shredded-Chicken-Recipe-500x500.jpg"},{"url":"https://theproteinchef.co/healthy-beef-and-broccoli-recipe/","title":"Healthy Beef and Broccoli","categories":["Beef","Want to Try"],"description":"A stovetop beef-and-broccoli meal with a lighter savory sauce, adapted from The Protein Chef.","prepTime":"5 mins","cookTime":"20 mins","totalTime":"25 mins","yield":"5 plates","ingredients":["2 lb lean beef, such as top round, chopped","2 tsp low-sodium soy sauce","1/2 tsp black pepper","1 tbsp cornstarch","1 tbsp sesame oil for cooking","2 tsp minced garlic","1/4 cup low-sodium beef broth","1 tbsp sesame oil for the sauce","1 tbsp brown-sugar substitute","4 tbsp low-sodium oyster sauce","1 1/2 tsp ground ginger","1 tbsp cornstarch mixed with 2 tbsp cold water","1 head broccoli (about 1 lb / 450 g), chopped"],"instructions":["Toss beef with soy sauce, pepper and 1 tablespoon cornstarch until evenly coated.","Whisk broth, sesame oil, brown-sugar substitute, oyster sauce, ginger and the cornstarch slurry in a small bowl.","Boil broccoli for 3-4 minutes until tender, then drain.","Heat 1 tablespoon sesame oil in a large pan or wok over medium-high heat. Cook beef for a few minutes per side; add garlic during the final minute.","Add sauce and cooked broccoli. Stir and simmer over low heat for a few minutes, until the sauce thickens."],"image":"https://media.theproteinchef.co/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/Healthy-Beef-and-Broccoli-Recipe-500x500.jpg"},{"url":"https://theproteinchef.co/easy-cottage-cheese-mac-and-cheese-recipe/","title":"Easy Cottage Cheese Mac and Cheese","categories":["Pasta","Want to Try"],"description":"Creamy stovetop mac and cheese made with a blended cottage-cheese sauce, adapted from The Protein Chef.","prepTime":"5 mins","cookTime":"15 mins","totalTime":"20 mins","yield":"6 bowls","ingredients":["10 oz pasta","Bone broth for cooking pasta (optional)","1 cup cottage cheese","5 oz cheddar cheese","1 cup milk or milk substitute","1 1/2 tbsp cornstarch","1/2 tsp garlic powder","1/4 tsp ground mustard","1/2 tsp smoked paprika","1/4 tsp onion salt","1/4 tsp black pepper","12 oz cooked chicken, beef, turkey or tuna (optional)"],"instructions":["Cook pasta according to the package directions, optionally using low-sodium bone broth in place of water.","Blend cottage cheese, cheddar, milk, cornstarch and seasonings until smooth.","Pour the sauce into a large saucepan over low heat. Stir for a few minutes, until it begins to thicken.","Fold in the cooked pasta and optional cooked protein. Continue stirring until hot and creamy."],"image":"https://media.theproteinchef.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Easy-Cottage-Cheese-Mac-and-Cheese-Recipe-500x500.jpg"},{"url":"https://theproteinchef.co/healthy-tomato-soup-with-protein-recipe/","title":"Healthy Tomato Soup with Protein","categories":["Soups","Want to Try"],"description":"Creamy roasted tomato soup with cottage cheese and basil pesto, adapted from The Protein Chef.","prepTime":"55 mins","cookTime":"15-20 mins","totalTime":"1 hr 10-15 mins","yield":"4 bowls","ingredients":["5 oz carrots, chopped or baby carrots","1 onion, chopped","28 oz can whole peeled tomatoes","1 tbsp olive oil","3 cups low-sodium bone broth","4 tsp minced garlic","5 tbsp tomato paste","1 1/2 tsp oregano","4 tbsp basil pesto","1 cup cottage cheese","Salt and black pepper to taste","Cooked chicken for extra protein (optional)"],"instructions":["Heat oven to 375 F (190 C). Put carrots, onion and the whole tomatoes from the can on a lined baking sheet, reserving the can juices.","Coat vegetables with olive oil, salt and pepper. Roast for about 50 minutes, until tender and browned.","Blend the roasted vegetables with reserved tomato liquid, broth, garlic, tomato paste, oregano, pesto and cottage cheese until smooth.","Transfer to a saucepan and warm over low heat for 15-20 minutes, stirring regularly. Add optional cooked chicken while reheating."],"image":"https://media.theproteinchef.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Healthy-Tomato-Soup-with-Protein-Recipe-500x500.jpg"},{"url":"https://keto.recipes/low-carb-italian-chicken-tenders-quick-easy-tasty/","title":"Low-Carb Italian Chicken Tenders","categories":["Chicken","Keto","Want to Try"],"description":"Three-ingredient chicken tenders coated with Italian dressing and Parmesan, adapted from Keto Recipes.","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"20 mins","totalTime":"30 mins","yield":"4 servings","ingredients":["1 lb chicken tenders","1/2 cup sugar-free Italian dressing","1/2 cup grated Parmesan","1 tsp garlic powder (optional)","1 tsp onion powder (optional)","1/4 tsp black pepper (optional)","Red pepper flakes or dried Italian herbs to taste (optional)"],"instructions":["Heat oven to 425 F (220 C) and line a baking sheet with parchment paper.","Toss chicken tenders with Italian dressing until coated. Add Parmesan and optional seasonings, then toss again.","Arrange tenders with space between them. Bake for about 20 minutes, until golden and the centers reach 165 F (74 C).","Rest for a few minutes before serving."],"image":"https://keto.recipes/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/3-ingredient-italian-dressing-chicken-tenders_plated-530x530.jpg"},{"url":"https://alldayidreamaboutfood.com/tiramisu-protein-mousse/","title":"Tiramisu Protein Mousse","categories":["Keto","Want to Try"],"description":"A chilled espresso and cocoa mousse with cottage cheese and protein powder, adapted from All Day I Dream About Food.","prepTime":"30 mins","cookTime":"1-2 hrs chilling","totalTime":"2 hrs 30 mins","yield":"4 servings","ingredients":["1/4 cup warm water","1 1/2 tsp espresso powder","1 tsp gelatin","1/2 cup cottage cheese or ricotta","1/3 cup unflavored whey protein powder","1/3 cup powdered sweetener","3/4 cup chilled heavy whipping cream","1/2 tsp vanilla extract","2 tbsp cocoa powder","1/2 oz sugar-free dark chocolate"],"instructions":["Whisk warm water with espresso powder. Sprinkle gelatin over the surface and let it bloom for a few minutes, then warm gently and whisk until dissolved.","Blend cottage cheese, protein powder and powdered sweetener until smooth. Transfer to a bowl and stir in the espresso mixture.","Whip the cream with vanilla to stiff peaks, then gently fold it into the cottage-cheese mixture.","Layer one third of the mousse into four cups, dust with cocoa, and repeat. Add the final mousse layer and shave dark chocolate over each cup.","Chill for 1-2 hours before serving."],"image":"https://alldayidreamaboutfood.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Tiramisu-Protein-Mousse-Recipe-300x300.jpg"},{"url":"https://alldayidreamaboutfood.com/keto-blueberry-smoothies/","title":"Keto Blueberry Smoothie","categories":["Breakfast","Keto","Want to Try"],"description":"A thick blueberry smoothie with Greek yogurt, protein powder and optional chia seeds, adapted from All Day I Dream About Food.","prepTime":"5 mins","cookTime":"","totalTime":"5 mins","yield":"2 servings","ingredients":["1 cup ice","3/4 cup high-protein Greek yogurt","3/4 cup unsweetened almond or hemp milk","1/2 cup frozen blueberries","1/3 cup unflavored whey protein powder","2 tbsp powdered sweetener","1 tbsp heavy cream","1 tbsp chia seeds (optional)"],"instructions":["Pulse the ice in a blender a few times until crushed.","Add the remaining ingredients and blend until smooth.","Taste and adjust the sweetener, then divide between two glasses."],"image":"https://alldayidreamaboutfood.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Bluberry-Smoothie-Recipe-300x300.jpg"},{"url":"https://alldayidreamaboutfood.com/sausage-egg-and-cheese-bites/","title":"Sausage Egg and Cheese Bites","categories":["Breakfast","Keto","Want to Try"],"description":"Mini egg bites with sausage, cottage cheese and cheddar, adapted from All Day I Dream About Food.","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"26 mins","totalTime":"36 mins","yield":"40 mini bites (8 servings)","ingredients":["12 oz bulk breakfast or Italian sausage","5 large eggs","3/4 cup cottage cheese","2 garlic cloves, minced","3/4 tsp salt","3/4 tsp black pepper","6 oz shredded cheddar, divided"],"instructions":["Heat oven to 325 F (163 C). Lightly grease 40 silicone mini-muffin cups and set the flexible pans on baking sheets.","Brown sausage in a large skillet until cooked through, about 6 minutes.","Blend eggs, cottage cheese, garlic, salt and pepper until smooth. Stir in the sausage and 4 oz of the cheddar.","Divide among the mini-muffin cups and sprinkle with the remaining cheese. Bake for 15-20 minutes, until puffed and firm.","Cool in the pans for a few minutes, then remove the bites."],"image":"https://alldayidreamaboutfood.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Keto-Egg-Bites-Recipe-300x300.jpg"},{"url":"https://alldayidreamaboutfood.com/slow-cooker-beef-tips/","title":"Slow Cooker Beef Tips","categories":["Beef","Keto","Want to Try"],"description":"Tender beef and browned mushrooms in a low-carb slow-cooker gravy, adapted from All Day I Dream About Food.","prepTime":"15 mins","cookTime":"8 hrs low / 5 hrs high","totalTime":"About 8 hrs 30 mins on low","yield":"6 servings","ingredients":["2 tbsp butter","8 oz mushrooms, sliced","Salt and black pepper","2 lb top sirloin, chuck steak or stew meat, cut into even bite-size pieces","1 cup beef broth","3 garlic cloves, minced","1 tbsp tomato paste","2 tsp Worcestershire or soy sauce","1 tsp onion powder","1/2 tsp glucomannan or xanthan gum"],"instructions":["Melt butter in a skillet over medium-high heat. Season and brown the mushrooms for 3-4 minutes, then transfer them to the slow cooker.","Season beef and sear it in batches on all sides. Transfer the beef and pan juices to the slow cooker.","Stir in broth, garlic, tomato paste, Worcestershire sauce and onion powder. Cover and cook on low for 8 hours or high for 5 hours, until tender.","Remove about 1 cup of the cooking liquid and whisk in the thickener. Stir it back into the slow cooker and adjust seasoning before serving."],"image":"https://alldayidreamaboutfood.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Beef-Tips-Recipe-450x450.jpg"},{"url":"https://alldayidreamaboutfood.com/cheesy-spinach-casserole/","title":"Cheesy Spinach Casserole","categories":["Side","Keto","Want to Try"],"description":"A bubbly spinach casserole with cottage cheese, Gruyere and Parmesan, adapted from All Day I Dream About Food.","prepTime":"10 mins","cookTime":"30 mins","totalTime":"40 mins","yield":"6 servings","ingredients":["1 tbsp butter or olive oil","1/4 cup chopped onion","4 garlic cloves, minced","15 oz fresh baby spinach (or thawed frozen spinach, squeezed dry)","1 tsp Italian seasoning","1/2 tsp salt","1/4 tsp black pepper","1/4 tsp red pepper flakes","1 cup cottage cheese","1 cup shredded Gruyere, divided","1/3 cup grated Parmesan, divided","1 large egg"],"instructions":["Heat oven to 375 F (190 C). Melt butter in a large skillet over medium heat and soften the onion for about 3 minutes.","Add garlic, Italian seasoning, salt, pepper and red pepper flakes; cook for 1 minute. Add spinach in batches and cook until just wilted, about 5 minutes.","Use a slotted spoon to transfer the spinach mixture to a bowl, leaving excess liquid behind. Stir in cottage cheese, half the Gruyere, half the Parmesan and the egg.","Spread in a 1 1/2- to 2-quart baking dish and top with the remaining cheeses. Bake about 25 minutes, until bubbly and beginning to brown."],"image":"https://alldayidreamaboutfood.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Cheesy-Keto-Spinach-Casserole-Recipe-450x450.jpg"}];
